{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1501179-in-the-hallowed-light-mtaw2e-ic","id":1501179,"title":"In the Hallowed Light [MtAw2e - IC]","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play","Play by Post"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-01-23T16:32:43-08:00","id":1501179,"title":"In the Hallowed Light [MtAw2e - IC]","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b>IN THE HALLOWED LIGHT</b></div> <br /> <br /> Situated in the northern reaches of Washington State, USA, Little Atlantis is a bayside town just beneath the US/Canadian border. Though hardly small, the proportion of Mages in residence is surprisingly high - a full Consilium that rivals Seattle\u2019s own in size. The reasons for this are myriad - the name alone, no known Seer activity for almost half a century, a friendly relationship with the local Changeling Freehold and their egress from Tumbledown Market, mysterious ruins off the coast that only Sleepers can see and can never be found twice- but the greatest draw is likely the fact that the entire bay is a Hallow.<br /> <br /> Well, that\u2019s an exaggeration. It\u2019s more accurate to say that every inch of the town plays host to one Hallow or another, but said Hallows cycle on such erratic schedules that you\u2019d never know it at a glance. The Mages who call Little Atlantis home have settled and claimed the most stable of these, and rumors abound that somewhere within the town limits sits a Supernal Verge keyed to the Aether. Perhaps even an Aedes.<br /> <br /> The Little Atlantis Consilium is run by the Hierarch Santiago, a Guardian of the Veil belonging to the Benthic Walker Legacy. He is attended by a council of four, each representing the other Pentacle Orders. These are, in no particular order:<ul><li>Dantes, Subtle One and Adamant Sage of the Adamant Arrow</li> <li>Clean Sweep, Keeper of the Covenant and Claviger of the Silver Ladder</li> <li>Nighthawk, Bokor and \u201cSyndic\u201d of the Free Council</li> <li>Mother Thunder, Storm Keeper and Savant of the Mysterium</li> </ul>Politics in the Consilium are relatively sedate - The Guardians are ascendant politically, and all four Diamond Orders are on an even footing in terms of membership. The Free Council is borderline anemic, having only two members, one of whom is Nighthawk. Most internal politicking and conflict actually arises between Cabals, or falls along Legacy lines. This distinction is blurred somewhat in that the three major Cabals are largely mono-Legacy organizations.<ul><li>The Skywatch Cabal are Storm Keepers led by the local Hierophant -and wife of Santiago- Cloudchaser, who focus on the weather and the vanishing ruins in the ocean.</li> <li>The Shadowwalker Cabal are mostly Keepers of the Covenant, guided by the Deacon Chevalier to study the effects of Hallows on the Shadow. As the only point of contact with local Werewolf population, they're held somewhat in awe by younger Mages.</li> <li>Lastly, The Iron Star Cabal are largely Hedgemarshals, who maintain a Mystery Cult alongside their Changelings allies under the direction of Dantes. Good people to call on for strange reagents and news from distant locals, but very dangerous to make enemies of.</li> </ul>The three Cabals have very firmly delineated areas of influence, and generally get along if those boundaries are respected. Independents make up a large portion of the Consilium\u2019s constituents, there being fourteen acknowledged Cabal-less Mages at the moment. Two of those, however, may not be so for long.<br /> <br /> Two months ago, Elpis\u2019s (<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar26736_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"26736\" data-vbnamecard=\"26736\">TempleBuilder</a>) mentor Pandora went Rapt and was swiftly put down by the Bellerophon Group under murky circumstances. Given that she had been outside Consilium territory when it happened, Elpis was unaware of their mentor\u2019s death until a local Guardian -an Emissary named Watchtower- suddenly showed up at their door several weeks after the fact. With most of Pandora\u2019s Supernally-adjacent possessions having been reclaimed by the Mysterium -including her library and Rapt Soulstone- Elpis has been left somewhat adrift. Cloudchaser, as their Order Head, seems to have finally realized that something should be done with this effectively-graduated apprentice, and has summoned them to her and Santiago\u2019s lighthouse home for an interview.<br /> <br /> Oddly, Cloudchaser has also summoned the apprentice of her cabal-mate Zephyr. This apprentice, Qaf (<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24280_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24280\" data-vbnamecard=\"24280\">KaiserAfini</a>), is a newly-minted member of the Adamant Arrow, and is in that murky state where he hasn\u2019t quite detached himself from the Cabal of his mentor.<br /> <br /> Cloudchaser has informed both parties that the other will be present, but not given many details beyond that. It\u2019s a sunny sunday afternoon, and in Cloudchaser\u2019s lighthouse home now looms over the young Mages as they approach the front door.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":27258,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","user":"Cauthon","date":". 01-23-2023, 07:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-29T15:56:20-08:00","id":1501642,"title":"","content":"<b>Elpis</b><br /> <br /> Elpis walks up the drive, completely lost in their own thoughts. The frigid sea breeze suddenly bites hard against their face, breaking their self-absorption. Bracing away from the gust, Elpis' gaze falls on the lighthouse. The building, which had only a brief time ago had been something of comfort, now seemed imposing and ominous. The entire journey over to the sanctum, had been putting them on edge, and here it was, looming over them only a few meters away. Elpis quickly looks away to glance at the time on their phone. A sigh of exasperation leaves the air fogged for a moment, before being quickly dispersed.<br /> <br /> <i>I shouldn't go in now, it's far too early. It would be... improper.</i><br /> <br /> Spotting a small overlook, Elpis walks over and stares at the sea. For the fortieth time, they pull out their phone and glance over the sparse email.<br /> <br /> <i>What does Cloudchaser want with me? Is it about...Pandora? How she's... Does Cloudchaser know about my investigation? If she does, will she tell me to stop? And why one of the Arrow? Qafsiel, right? Who is that? Have I met him? Should I know him? Why does Cloudchaser want him there? </i><br /> <br /> The tightness in Elpis' chest returns with a vengeance. Their breath comes in rapidly, short and sharp. Gradually, Elpis manages to get their breathing somewhat back under control. Their eyes dart to their phone, and they Imagine a flickering aura around their phone, which they then draw into a fine chord leading to their ears. Without looking at their phone, Elpis plays the music where it had last left off.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;- thought I heard the captain's voice<br /> But it's hard to listen while you preach<br /> Like every broken wave on the shore<br /> This is as far as I could reach\u200b&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Elpis barely makes it through one stanza before wiping away the flickering chords. Elpis decides that listening to music was a grave mistake, and begins to focus on the crashing waves. The air, while still cold, seems to have a softer bite now. Elpis' eyes remain on the shore for a moment before glancing at a marker pointing out how high the waters were. A way to occupy themselves began to appear in their mind, after all, the tide is dependent on the Sun and Moon's gravitational pull. The lunar phase could hypothetically be calculated based on the tidal position. Elpis' expression begins to lighten slightly at the puzzle and they set to work trying to piece it together.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-29T16:53:07-08:00","id":1501647,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"img_align_center_wrapper\"><img width=\"450\" height=\"338\" data-align=\"center\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://i.pinimg.com/originals/59/f0/c0/59f0c0a63f48a26e771069dc711d192e.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://i.pinimg.com/originals/59/f0/c0/59f0c0a63f48a26e771069dc711d192e.jpg\" data-thumb-url=\"https://i.pinimg.com/originals/59/f0/c0/59f0c0a63f48a26e771069dc711d192e.jpg\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment align_center js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/></div><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;Your early!&quot;<br /> <br /> It takes Elpis a moment to locate the speaker - a tall, dark man with a salt-and-peppered beard and a clean-shaven pate. Standing at the railing of the beacon, with his back to the sun, it takes a momentary squint to see that it is Santiago, the Hierarch. It's difficult to make out his expression, but he sounds fairly chipper.<br /> <br /> &quot;Piper's still down checking her monitoring stations, it will be an hour or so yet until she returns from Braem Wood. You are free to shiver out there if you like - there is a pleasant view if you head up that path to your right. But I have cocoa on the stove if you wish to wait inside.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":27258,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","user":"Cauthon","date":". 01-30-2023, 01:19 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-29T17:51:20-08:00","id":1501655,"title":"","content":"Elpis hadn't expected to be spoken to out here, much less been invited inside. It takes them a moment to recover from their shock.<br /> <br /> &quot;Ah, thank you. I will come inside in a moment&quot;<br /> <br /> Elpis briefly wonders if they made the right choice, before walking toward the front door.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-29T22:18:31-08:00","id":1501667,"title":"","content":"The kitchen is cluttered, but clean, with relatively new appliances and a wide assortment of metal and wooden tools. Postcards written in Korean, Chinese, and Thai hand on the fridge, held in place by souvenir magnets from around the world. The ceiling has been painted as a surprisingly detailed depiction of a satellite-imaged storm system, which looks like it continues further on into the house. A teapot whistles quietly on the stovetop, sweet-smelling steam rising from the spout. An empty mug sits on the counter beside the stove, with a sticky note reading &quot;Elpis&quot; stuck to the side. The whole house smells faintly of cinnemon and nutmeg, undercut in slightly unpleasant contrast by the scent of cooked grease.<br /> <br /> Santiago's descent from the upper levels of the house make a deep drumming on the stairs, giving Elpis plenty of forewarning to his entrace. Dressed in paint-splattered jeans and a worn plaid shit, the looming Thyrsus seems surprisingly harmless. He gives a friendly smile as he enters the room, gesturing amiably to the kettle.<br /> <br /> &quot;Help yourself. I have some peppermint schnapps you can add - Piper, she like a spash of it, although I prefer to just add some extract from the start. Of course, then she complains that the mint is too strong.&quot; He sighs dramatically, then winks &quot;I cannot win sometimes. In any event, I will be vacating the premise once you and the Heirophant have your sit-down. I do not think we have actually met outside of Consilium functions - I know you are Elpis, one of Mother Thunder's constituents. You are an Exemplum, correct?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":27258,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","user":"Cauthon","date":". Damn my inability to type. 01-30-2023, 06:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-30T14:39:56-08:00","id":1501745,"title":"","content":"Elpis smiles slightly, enjoying the cozy feeling and interesting aesthetics of Santiago's and Cloudchaser's home, and begins to head over to the mug and kettle.<br /> <br /> &quot;Quite true, though I seem to hear neokoros more often. I have been told that I must pursue Gnosis to make myself ready for further steps. In the meantime, I have been working on my studies in Soriology, particularly around the effects, and manifestations of the Awakened Nimbus. It's fascinating to see how one's personality, actions, Wisdom, and connection to the Supernal all manifest themselves in the world.&quot;<br /> <br /> They make their way to the kettle and carefully pour the contents into the mug set aside for them. They appreciate the gesture of leaving a sticky note with their name on it. &quot;I'm afraid I will have to decline the peppermint, I usually prefer peppermint in the form of candy.&quot; They take a small sip and turn around to face Santiago. &quot;I quite enjoy the decorative style of your home, it's quite comforting.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-05T16:03:41-08:00","id":1502253,"title":"","content":"\u201cAaah, my apologies Neokoros. I suppose I was aware that you had graduated, it simply slipped my mind. Your Soriology focus\u2026 that is Magosophy, correct? I will admit, the Hierophant has tried to explain the fields to me several times, but I rarely seem to retain the information.\u201c<br /> <br /> He smiles brightly at the complement, looking up at the ceiling\u2019s swirling patterns. \u201cDo you think so? It was a pleasant project Piper and I spent several months perfecting. We have been trying to work out a similar style using constellations on the second floor. The arguments over which phases should go where have been quite invigorating. The Big Dipper in the bathroom? Ridiculous! It would throw off the whole Eastern Hemisphere. And obviously Bufo belongs in the study.\u201d<br /> <br /> Suddenly the Hierarch\u2019s head snaps around, eyes narrowed down to predatory slits. Setting down his mug of coco, he stalks into the livingroom, towards the front door.<br /> <br /> \u201cIf you would not mind, Neokoros, please ready yourself. Someone is coming down the drive. There were to be two of you today, but I did not expect both to come so early. If it is not the young Arrow, I may call upon you for assistance.\u201d<br /> \u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":27258,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","user":"Cauthon","date":". 02-06-2023, 04:46 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-05T20:03:41-08:00","id":1502277,"title":"","content":"Elpis backs up nervously, puts down the mug, and fumbles for their satchel. They quickly rummage through the contents, before pulling out a bottle of pepper spray, and a small polished steel marble. Elpis places the marble on the counter and makes sure they can see their reflection in the marble. They focus on their reflection and position themselves to be able to quickly obscure their reflection. They then look up to the Hierarch.<br /> <br /> &quot;Ready.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-07T14:52:47-08:00","id":1502441,"title":"","content":"<b>Qafsiel</b><br /> <br /> Qaf is making his way up the drive, a couple of minutes early, having decided to walk to enjoy the nice day. Despite the customary chill of winter, he can't help but find the smell of the salty sea air and the sound of the crashing waves below relaxing. He looks at the lighthouse for a few moments, before his Awakening he would never have guessed it was a modern day wizard tower. But then again, the view alone makes it worth having a Sanctum here.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;I wonder why Cloudchaser summoned me. She mentioned wanting me to meet another Mystagogue, I think she said they were called Elpis....Elpis like the Greek goddess of hope ? I don't think I even heard about them before. Well, Zephyr did say that I need more practical experience, maybe I am being recruited to provide some extra protection on a research project ? Maybe....well, no point agonizing over it, I will find out soon enough. Besides...&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Qaf looks at a box in his hands, giving off the smell of baked goods. Inside there is an assortment of sweet and salty bagels, which he had the good fortune to buy fresh out of the oven.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;...nothing breaks the ice like a chat over bagels. Lets see what this is all about&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Qaf walks towards the door and rings the doorbell.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 02-07-2023, 06:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-09T15:37:56-08:00","id":1502650,"title":"","content":"Both Elpis and Qaf's Peripheral Mage Sights react as Santiago casts a spell. After a moment spent staring blankly at the door, the sensation abates.<br /> <br /> Elpis can see the Hierarch's serious -and honestly, somewhat hunted- expression quickly vanish under a stong veneer of jovial welcome as he throws the door open wide.<br /> <br /> Qaf, on the other hand, is greeted only by the smile, and ushered into the building.<br /> &quot;Ah, Qaf! Please come in lad. You and the young Mystagog here are commendably eager it seems - we have a bit of time yet before your meeting with my wife. Have some coco with us and chat for a bit.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-09T17:01:49-08:00","id":1502658,"title":"","content":"Elpis sighs, and quickly puts the pepper spray and the marble up, and tries to slow their racing of their heart. They keep their eyes on the Hierarch for a moment, watching him interact with Qaf. <br /> <br /> \u201c<i>What was that about? That intensity of emotion\u2026Was that simply caution, or is something else going on? What am I missing?\u201d</i><br /> <br /> Elpis starts, remembering the need for introductions, picks up the mug, and waits until Qaf has a a clear view of them to wave.<br /> <br /> \u201dHello. I am Elpis. Nice to meet you.\u201d<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-10T17:29:27-08:00","id":1502720,"title":"","content":"&quot;Thank you, I brought us some freshly baked bagels&quot;<br /> <br /> Qaf politely enters the home, he looks up to see the patterns above &quot;<i>The view of the night sky really brings it all together. I wonder if one day they will want to include Orion and Ophiuncus, those two constellations don't stay put, maybe they would use Forces and Prime to make the constellations from animated invisible runes.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Qaf starts making his way towards the direction Santiago indicated. Qaf waves back at Elphis with his free hand.<br /> <br /> &quot;Pleasure to meet you Elpis, I am Qafsiel, or Qaf for short&quot;<br /> <br /> Qafsiel is a man in his 20s, about 1.90m tall, with short brown hair and leaf green eyes, with a look of relaxed attention.<br /> <br /> Qaf places the box of bagels on a table, within easy reach of anyone &quot;I was able to buy these hot off the oven&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 02-10-2023, 10:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-13T17:24:49-08:00","id":1502972,"title":"","content":"<i>I should note for carity - the ground floor doesn't have constelations, the second floor does. The ground floor is a satellite-view image of storm systems</i><br /> <br /> &quot;Bagels! Lovely. I may have some lox in the fridge, just a moment.&quot; Santiago gestures vaguely at the seats in the livingroom, wooden frames supporting plump cushions and covered by brightly striped cloth. &quot;The pair of you may as well chat.&quot;<br /> <br /> His face hardens momentarily, as if he has just remembered something. &quot;And while you have no doubt been told before, please refrain from using Prime Unveiling or Knowing spells while on the premises. Quite aside from the privacy violation, some of our wards are... indiscriminate.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-13T20:43:43-08:00","id":1502995,"title":"","content":"Elpis smiles at Qaf, and silently notes that he definitely looks like he works out.<br /> <br /> &quot;Ah, thank you. I didn't eat much earlier, so they are most welcome&quot; Elpis grabs one of the proffered bagels, and pauses at Santiago's words. They consider them for a moment, then glance over to Qaf to see if he is heading toward the living room. After a moment, they head towards the living room and take a seat. They wait until Qaf has entered the room and made himself comfortable before trying to make conversation with Qaf.<br /> <br /> &quot;Uh so, do you know why we have been summoned? The email I got was...sparse.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-14T16:32:10-08:00","id":1503080,"title":"","content":"Qaf nods after hearing the warning, while he did not plan to violate hospitality, he makes a mental note not to accidentally activate the wards that are way above his weight class. He then makes his way to the living room.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Elpis looks like someone who pays more attention to their fitness than most, probably. Its hard to tell for certain with so many layers of clothes, I wonder why use so many in such a warm indoor environment. I was taught to be ready for anything when operating under my Shadow Name, too many layers does the same as wearing baggy clothes, it doesn't allow you to move freely. Maybe Elpis hasn't seen much combat when exploring the Mysteries ?&quot;</i><br /> <br /> &quot;No idea, at least not beyond the assumption that it is about a sensitive topic. All my email told me was that we would be meeting with Cloudchaser. My best guess was that it was about something you were researching, but you look just as surprised by the reason as I am, so it seems to have missed the mark&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 02-14-2023, 07:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-14T22:07:29-08:00","id":1503108,"title":"","content":"Elpis nods and then begins to stare into space. Thoughts begin to start whirling across their mind.<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>So Qaf doesn't know either. What does that mean? It means that we are going to be told together, and if we are being told together, we will be working together. No need to tell us separately, when we could be both told at once. What would require the two of us? An Arrow and a Mystagogue? A research mission? </i><i>Unlikely, I don't have that kind of standing in the </i> <i>Mysterium yet, and I don't think my normal research warrants a guard. No, we would be working together in general, which means...a cabal!&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Elpis nods, certain of their deduction, and glances at Qaf before starting into space again.<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>Why a cabal? And with an Arrow too...this is about Pandora, isn't it?&quot; </i>Elpis sighs, feeling the increasingly familiar ache return. <i>&quot;We were going to be formally recognized as a Cabal, weren't we? Is that your reason, Cloudchaser? Does the Consilium need another cabal? No, that feels insufficient. Maybe this is in fact a mission for us, I shouldn't dismiss the possibility out of hand. Could this be about my investigation? Does she know? Is that why I need to be in a cabal?</i>&quot; Anger flashes hot and quick. <i>&quot;I'm doing fine. I can find out what happened to Pandora on my own. I don't need help.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Elpis look up for a moment, anger still arcing through their mind, when see happen to see out a window, to the crashing sea. As they watch the waves, the lyrics to the song they had been listening to come to mind.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;- thought I heard the captain's voice<br /> But it's hard to listen while you preach<br /> Like every broken wave on the shore<br /> This is as far as I could reach\u200b&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Suddenly, all the anger melts away, leaving only weariness in its wake.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;...Am I really doing ok? I haven't made any real progress on my own. I don't know where she was going or what she was doing, and I don't know how I can find out. Almost all of her possessions have been confiscated, and I don't have any real leads. What I really need is to see the past, and see where she went, but I never did study Time. Maybe...Maybe I should try to work together with Qaf. If nothing else, he might know someone.&quot; </i>Elpis looks back at Qaf when a new thought strikes them. <i>&quot;I'm going to need to tell him, aren't I? I don't think he recognized me, maybe he doesn't know about Pandora? Maybe he hasn't heard any rumors yet... If we are going to work together, I should tell him. It would be the right thing to do, wouldn't it?... I don't want him to hear it from someone else first. He seems kind. Maybe he will understand. I should tell him... Not about my investigation. Not before the meeting, I don't even know we are working together, much less if he would or could help. But I should tell him about Pandora at least. If we have the potential to work together, he should know. If we are working together, then I'll tell him everything after the meeting.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Elpis sighs. &quot;Hey\u200b, I think I might know what going on.&quot; They pause for a moment, then sigh again, and try to smile. &quot;Ok\u200b maybe not exactly, but I think it's a pretty safe bet that we will be working together soon. And if that's the case, I think there is something you should know.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-15T10:18:18-08:00","id":1503147,"title":"","content":"Qaf sees Elpis go through an emotional roller coaster over a few seconds. <br /> <br /> <i>&quot;So its not only private, but also very personal and not a comfortable topic. Lets treat this with the seriousness it deserves&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Qaf, who was previously sitting in a comfortable yet erect position, inclines forward a bit, puts his hands in a lowered steepled position and nods.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-15T19:20:17-08:00","id":1503200,"title":"","content":"Elpis takes Qaf's change of posture as a good sign and continues.<br /> <br /> &quot;My mentor, Pandora, she...fell into Rapture. I'm told she was a danger to herself, and those around her. She was found and laid to rest. I...wasn't there. She had left on a business trip, and I had been left to guard our sanctum. After about a day, I saw distortions form from her soul stone. I studied them, and when they proved dangerous tried to contain them as best I could. They weren't just limited to the soul stone, everything her nimbus had touched was open to the distortions. I couldn't strip her nimbus, but I warded things as best I could, and tried to mitigate what slipped through. I managed like that for a few days, until suddenly, the distortions ceased. I...guess that's when she died. A few weeks later, I learned from a Mage named Watchtower that Pandora had been killed. I've been..kinda a wreck after that.&quot; Elpis laughs weakly and continues. &quot;Anyways after that, everyone started handling things. Lots of stuff has happened since. It's been...rough. But I think I'm considered finished with my apprenticeship, which means I can be assigned work. Since I haven't really had anything yet, I can only imagine I will soon.&quot;<br /> <br /> Elpis sighs. &quot;Sorry for hitting you with that all at once, but if we might be working together, you should know.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":26736,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","user":"TempleBuilder","date":". 02-15-2023, 10:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-16T18:35:50-08:00","id":1503290,"title":"","content":"<i>&quot;I don't think anyone would be ok after hearing their mentor went Rapt, much less that they were suddenly killed. Had something similar had happened to Zephyr, I would probably be seeking more closure than simply getting the redacted version of the story. There is likely a good reason why its redacted, but still. Not sure if Elpis is l still searching though, but...&quot;</i><br /> <br /> &quot;My condolences for your loss, I don't think there is anyone who wouldn't be shaken to the core in a similar situation. Thank you for telling me&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Since those sighs indicate how uncomfortable this is, lets give them an easy out.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Qaf gets a cinnamon-sugar bagel to pair with the hot chocolate, going back to his more relaxed posture.<br /> <br /> &quot;I think you might be right, I completed my apprenticeship as a Talon recently and its likely I will get a field mission soon as well. I wonder what kind of assignment we will get. I am mostly a scout. Exploring, investigation, divination, that sort of thing. What about you, what do you specialize in ?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 02-17-2023, 01:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-17T14:52:49-08:00","id":1503342,"title":"","content":"Elpis takes a moment to process the shift in conversation.<br /> <br /> \u201dI think it would be accurate to say that I\u2019m still a student, even though my apprenticeship is over. I\u2019m currently studying the field of So\u200briology, with a heavy focus on Magosophy. Erm, basically I am studying the Awakened condition. My main area of active study though is the Nimbus. It\u2019s simply wonderful how one\u2019s connection to the Supernal manifests in this Fallen World. Everyone has a unique connection, which resonates with their sense of self, which then makes its way into the world around. I\u2019m currently reading a series of books penned by one Ariel of the Silvered Bough detailing her thoughts and experiences\u200b with the Nimbus of herself and her cabal, noting for example how one\u2019s personality changing over time affects their sense of self, and thereby their Nimbus. She noted how on of her cabal mages had recently had progressed in their chosen legacy, and postulates that the resulting change in their Nimbus was more a result of a change in their sense of self than furthering their connection to the Supernal. While I haven\u2019t really been around someone who was deepening their connection to a legacy, if I get the opportunity I\u2019d love to see the changes that would entail.\u201d<br /> <br /> Elpis pauses to take a long drink.<br /> <br /> \u201dOh, my bad, i\u2019ve gotten on a tangent. I believe I\u2019m more of a generalist than anything else, though I am more suited to academic pursuits than more physical activities. I\u2019m afraid I\u2019m not much of a warrior.\u201d","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-17T16:25:28-08:00","id":1503349,"title":"","content":"<i>&quot;So they are still looking into it. Studying the Nimbus to understand what exactly those manifestations of Pandora's Nimbus were. The strong personality extremes associated with Rapture, how someone's mental state affects their magic burning their way into the world and what caused the fall from Wisdom. They haven't given up, I respect that. Hmm...all the evidence was taken away and the story was censored, which means the easiest way to get anywhere is to observe the clues before they were spirited away. I think I see what this is all about now&quot;</i><br /> <br /> &quot;Don't worry about it. It sounds pretty fascinating, our perspective coloring how we practice the Art, construct our Imagos and leave our signature on reality. Based on Ariel's studies, it seems that observing these moments when there are powerful shifts in one's sense of self could provide insights on the nature of our connection to the Supernal. Moments of Gnostic revelation, initiation into a Legacy, internalizing a new Attainment or similar would be ideal. I believe Prime, Mind and perhaps Death sights would be the most convenient for that.&quot;<br /> <br /> Qaf drinks some of the hot chocolate.<br /> <br /> &quot;The difficult part is observing at just the right instant, but I think I can help with that. To make a long story short, my Awakening placed me in a part of the Aether that was temporaly altered, and an Angel gave me a warning to <i>&quot;Prepare&quot;</i>. Ever since then I have been studying Time to understand what he meant, and it just so happens that one of the rotes I learned was <i>Postcognition</i>. So should you run into any such fascinating moments you wish to examine, I would be more than happy to help you see them. All things considered, I would be surprised if Cloudchaser hadn't accounted for this&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;At the very least, it allows you to continue your investigation without officially opposing Watchtower, which is probably an unofficial goal of this meeting&quot;</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 02-18-2023, 09:50 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-19T20:35:23-08:00","id":1503511,"title":"","content":"Santiago reenters, carrying a plate of lox and several spreads for the bagels.<br /> <br /> &quot;Do not be overly trusting of the Aetherics, lad. We call them &quot;Angels&quot;, but at the end of the day they are merely the denizens of a storm so ferocious it could burn the universe to a crisp. They're powerful, but all the more alien for it.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-20T11:26:23-08:00","id":1503536,"title":"","content":"&quot;The denizens of a storm, but maybe also an element of it....even though that one word was all he said, it was like hearing a lightning bolt speak through the echoing thunder. I am not sure what it wants, or why, but I am interested in learning more. But I will keep a questioning mind and make no assumptions, you can't roll with the punches if you never see them coming&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-20T13:27:31-08:00","id":1503561,"title":"","content":"Elpis nods to Qaf's words.<br /> <br /> &quot;When a Charge builds, it seeks to distribute the excess. Though the path it takes may be destructive, it changes all it touches. It can do nothing else. Meaning too transforms those who receive it. An Angel must impart Meaning with its words, as Lightning must transmit Charge. Whatever its reasons, its words meant something. They would not have affected you so much if they hadn't. That being said, Angels can mislead as well as any other Supernal entity. I think you have the right idea.&quot;<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-20T16:28:40-08:00","id":1503573,"title":"","content":"Qaf nods.<br /> <br /> &quot;That metaphor hits the nail on the head in more ways than one. My Nimbus is, in fact, a surge of energy and it leaves behind a mild electric numbness.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-20T17:12:30-08:00","id":1503575,"title":"","content":"\u201cIf you don\u2019t mind, I\u2019d like to take you up on your offer. I\u2019d love the opportunity to see how the nimbus changes over time, though perhaps we should do so another time, give the wards on this location\u201d","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-20T19:52:16-08:00","id":1503592,"title":"","content":"&quot;Sounds good to me&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-22T19:02:51-08:00","id":1503718,"title":"","content":"&quot;Your discretion is appreciated.&quot; Santiago smiles wryly, preparing a bagel for himself. &quot;In any event...&quot;<br /> <br /> He turns towards the door just as it slams open, and a wirey woman in a thick jacket of neon orange slumps into the house. Loaded down with several bulky pelican cases, Hierophant Cloudchaser looks exhausted. Her glasses are fogged from the cold outside, and as such doesn't appear to notice Elpis and Qaf.<br /> <br /> &quot;The basted Werewolves have been messing with the weather over Braem Wood again, Patrick!&quot; The Hierophant's irritation is enough to have thickened her normally imperceptible accent, an odd mixture of Vietnamese and Korean. &quot;I don't bloody well know <i>how,</i> but this is the fifth time the clear skies I set up there have been overridden! Even the spirit-wards the Shadowwalkers <i>deigned </i>to set up for me didn't help, apparently!&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;You have returned earlier than you predicted, my love.&quot; Santiago's voice is gentle, if amused, as he moves to take a few of the cases. &quot;Your divination of when your guest would arrive, however, was spot on.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":27258,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","user":"Cauthon","date":". 02-22-2023, 10:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-24T10:37:40-08:00","id":1503824,"title":"","content":"&quot;<i>Aww, they're cute together. I should wait until they are ready for us. It's a bit strange seeing Cloudchaser like this....Wait, Werewolves? In Braem Wood? Werewolves can mess with the Weather? Oh shoot, I should make my greeting now.</i>&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Ah, Hello Cloudchaser. We have been enjoying Santiago's kind hospitality. You have a lovely home. I didn't realize my timing was quite so expected when I arrived. I had been under the assumption that I was too early.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-24T12:45:10-08:00","id":1503838,"title":"","content":"Cloudchaser hurriedly sets down the last of her cases, whipping off her glasses to wipe them clear. Smiling at Elpis, she gently chucks Santiago's chin.<br /> <br /> &quot;You didn't, dear? Who do you think left a mug out for you? I imagine my spouse was up in the tower when you arrived.&quot;<br /> <br /> Her expression grows somewhat perturbed, turning towards Qaf. &quot;You, on the other hand, I genuinely wasn't expecting to have arrived yet. Love, don't try and butter me up - one out of three accurate prognostications is a terrible success rate. I'm off my game this week.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-25T10:52:09-08:00","id":1503905,"title":"","content":"<i>&quot;Just like that, the frustration from the werewolves situation wore off, that is good to see. One thing doesn't make sense though, time magic normally makes errors when either there are too many variables in play, like a very far away future, or someone is tempering with the predictions. One prediction was her arrival, which involved some back and forth with werewolves, so fair enough. The second divination was when Elpis would arrive, which was spot on. But I wasn't doing anything particularly magical today, I wonder why I was a miss ? The simplest answer would be a Veiling of Time&quot;</i><br /> <br /> &quot;I am not sure why either, I haven't cast a Veiling, or done any spellcasting today. It was such a nice day that I opted for walking, went to buy some bagels, found them fresh off the oven. There wasn't much snow or slippery ice as normal, so I made surprisingly good time. I got here after Elpis, so we have been enjoying Santiago's hospitality and chatting for a bit.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Not sure if the order of our arrival is important, but it can't hurt add that bit of information. Between a case of sudden Rapture, an ominous Awakening and whatever Mysteries that Skywatch are looking into, there is probably something someone would be interested in. I would be remiss if I didn't provide some information for the more experienced mages to sanity check this, even if in a low key way&quot;</i><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-27T15:58:03-08:00","id":1504002,"title":"","content":"Cloudchaser sighs, nodding. &quot;I suppose it's just one more thing to look into.&quot; A grimace momentarily crinkles her tanned features &quot;Or it's a reminder that prophecy is fallible.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Indeed&quot; Santiago chuckles &quot;Well, in the interest of reliability - perhaps the three of you should begin your meeting? I will see to the cases, then head down to the beach.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;My deepest thanks!&quot; Cloudchaser replies mockingly, shedding her coat and settling into a tall-backed chair in front of the coffee table. Everyone's Peripheral Mage Sight tingles as a plastic binder suddenly appears in her outstertched hand, the cover marked with what appear to be High Speech runes.<br /> <br /> &quot;Well now my ducklings, have a seat. You may have some ideas about what I called you here for today, so let me put it bluntly to avoid the wilder speculation. Elpis, regardless of recent tradgedy, you're far enough along to warrant the end of your apprenticeship. I mean, we've even put you through the rituals already. As such, it's time for you to be declared an indepented Leige-person of the Consilium. While normally you'd be slowly shopped around the existing Cabals to find whom you want to join, my judgement is that you'd be a poor fit for the locals. Don't get me wrong!&quot; she adds hurriedly, &quot;we'd love to have you in Skywatch! But you've never shown any interest in the weather, and you'd need to change your Shadow Name to keep with the Cabal's theme.<br /> <br /> &quot;The other two are much the same - as far as I know, you have little skill or interest in the Spirit Arcana, so the Shadowwalkers likely have little appeal to you, and the Hedgemarshals are a touch more violent than I'd peg you for. Nothing for it then but to either let you be an independent, or dictate a Cabal. I've elected to do the latter, as my prerogative. Which is where our Qaf comes in. As another recent graduate, you're in dire need of direction young man. Zephyr and Sirocco both claim you to be a good Arrow, but not one interested in the weather or spirits. The Marshals might hold some appeal, but Dantes, as your Adamant Sage, has agreed to assign you to be Banner Warden to Elpis.<br /> <br /> &quot;Assuming that neither of you has a particular objections -and I will stress that the only objections I will accept are &quot;I've been accepted into another Cabal already&quot; or &quot;I have irrefutable proof this person is Left Handed&quot;- Santiago has rubberstamped the basic paperwork. The two of you should decide on a Cabal name -although we don't need that <i>today</i>, necessarily- and the three of us will see about setting you up with a Hallow.&quot;<br /> <br /> She taps the binder meaningfully. &quot;Little Atlantis has quite a few, obviously, but only a handful are reliable. The Consilium holds a few in trust, and I can offer some Mysterium ones if none suit. Dantes was also generous enough to provide some Arrow-owned options, though I will stress those are a last resort.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":27258,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","user":"Cauthon","date":". 02-27-2023, 08:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-27T18:41:58-08:00","id":1504012,"title":"","content":"<i>&quot;Elpis was right on target. Well, I am curious about the Hallows. However, moving on to that would be assuming that Elpis has no objections, so lets provide some breathing room&quot;</i><br /> <br /> &quot;I have no objections, so if Elpis is also okay with it, so am I.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-27T19:10:12-08:00","id":1504014,"title":"","content":"&quot;<i>So I was correct. Looks like I made the right choice to tell Qaf after all. So, I guess I'll need to tell him about my investigation later...I think Qaf is a good guy. I have to learn more about him, especially if I'm going to work with him, but right now my answer is clear.&quot;<br /> &quot;</i>I also have no objections, so I guess that settles it.&quot;<br /> &quot;<i>Right, Hallows. I wonder if I have examined any of these before?</i>&quot;<br /> &quot;So what are our options?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-27T20:18:02-08:00","id":1504015,"title":"","content":"&quot;Well, let's start with the common-property ones. You may have glimpsed some of these in passing.&quot; Cloudchaser pulls a map out of the binder, laying it out on the coffee table. Highly detailed, it looks like a city planner's document, but criss-crossed with colorful lines and unusual symbols. It also extends quite far into the surrounding forests. She taps a series of small triangular marks annotated on the paper, reading off of what appear to be dossiers as she does.<br /> <br /> &quot;Firsty, we have the Prospect Yard Graveyard in the Old Town. It's a relatively strong Hallow, and needs very little maintenance. However, it has several significant limitations for your use. Firstly, the Hallow itself is located in the gazebo at the center of the cemetery. The plots all radiate around it, so you'll likely be in full view when you visit. The Oblation is simple, at least, if a bit depressing. You need to sing a funeral dirge within the gazebo - any song will do, but it needs to be funerary. Which ties into the second thing of note; three of the six arches of the gazebo are Avernian Gates. At <i>least</i> three, we've never quite been able to confirm. Nighthawk -the Free Council Councilor?- is the primary expert on that, and is, herself, thing-of-significance number three. She is to have unlimited access to those gates at all times, and has first claim on all bodies interred on the grounds. I'll note that she hasn't actually exercised that crossing right since she became a Master of Death and could open her own Irises, but the potential for being accused of any grave robbery she might commit might be a turnoff. The Mana, at least, will be all yours.<br /> <br /> &quot;Second, we have Njord's Draught down by the docks. It's a... pub, I guess? Better food than a bar, but alcohol is definitely what draws the patrons. We partially fund the place, because of the Hallow. It's run by a Changeling, and the place is lousy with Hedgegates, or so the Marshals tell me. As such, the Marshals have crossing rights to talk with their contacts or use the Irises. In it's favor, though, is the built-in security that provides, and the Tass. Y'see, the Hallow is located in the Draught's storeroom, and the proprietor just has to keep liquid in that spot for about a day to infuse it. Gilligan -the Changeling- gets half of all such infused beverages, and usually sells them. If you claim the place, the Consilium\u2019s Tass-shares will start going to you. How much access to the actual premises you get will have to be worked out between you two and Gil.<br /> <br /> \u201cThird is the Stone Oak, waaaay out here in the woodlands by Braem Wood.\u201d Her brow furrows momentarily in irritation \u201cOf the common-property Hallows, this is probably the thorniest, if you want it. The Stone Oak is a huge oak tree that seems to be growing directly out of the sheer side of a cliff. It\u2019s fascinating. Of course, few people ever see it, because in addition to the Hallow in it\u2019s boughs, the entire thing is a Loci. One owned by the local wolfpack. We\u2019ve a longstanding agreement with them to help keep the place warded and secret, in exchange for access to the Hallow. If you want to claim it, you\u2019ll have to meet with the pack and convince them. Good protection, but primarily as a result of bad neighbors.<br /> <br /> \u201cFourth is Hyleen Cottage. It\u2019s\u2026 literally a cottage, up on the heights in Old Town. No-one has lived there in years, which is the main downside. You\u2019ll need to do a lot of fixing up if you want it to be a sanctum. The Oblation is to tend a fire in the central hearths - quite pleasant in winter, but murder in the summer. Not a strong Hallow, but it\u2019s out of the way.<br /> <br /> \u201cLast is Tesslin\u2019s Hollow. It\u2019s the quarry-lake just east of town hall, and boy is that Hallow a <i>bitch</i> to get to. It\u2019s located at the very bottom, with the Tass mostly coalescing in the kelp some lunatic started cultivating a couple decades back. It\u2019s a strong Hallow, and Santiago was always talking about claiming it with a houseboat when we first married, but it\u2019s really too inconvenient for most people.<br /> <br /> \u201cI\u2019ll tell you about the Mysterium properties next, if none of these strike your fancy. Decisions today don\u2019t have to be final, either. We can go for a tour of any that resonate with you, if you need a tie-breaker.\u201d<br /> \u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":27258,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","user":"Cauthon","date":". 03-20-2023, 01:17 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-28T07:42:53-08:00","id":1504041,"title":"","content":"&quot;Based on the overview, my initial impression is that our our best bets are either Hyleen Cottage or the Njord's Draught.<br /> <br /> The cottage seems low key, the oblation is practical and I think if we put in some work, it might make for a pretty good Sanctum.<br /> <br /> The bar would make a good place to build contacts and is well defended. The tass is easy to carry as well and, so long as we keep an amicable relationship with Gil, we should be ok. The main drawback is the possibility of being caught in the crossfire of whatever the Hedgemarshals are currently doing.<br /> <br /> The Stone Oak is the only one I am strongly against. I cannot perceive spirits and have no diplomatic experience with werewolves. While it is a powerful Hallow and very well defended, if things go poorly, it presents danger we are not equipped to deal with and is in the most isolated location.<br /> <br /> Looking at Prospect Graveyard, while I would not be unsettled by being in one, I cannot perceive ghosts, so I would have difficulty communicating with them. This might not be an issue if Elpis knows the Death Arcanum.<br /> <br /> The location of the Hallow means we would have a difficult time mediating into the Astral without looking suspicious. We would also need to be doubly careful not to cause Dissonance near it. Lastly, while I have no issue with Nighthawk's crossing, we have a minimum of 3 Avernian Gates acting as potential backdoors to the location, with probably more unaccounted for. From a security standpoint, those build up to meaningful liabilities.<br /> <br /> Tesslin's Hollow is tempting, the tass is light and easy to carry. Harvesting is the challenge, its especially inconvenient to do so in winter. It would require a lot of work or a high cost to setup a reliable way to harness it, in addition to the extra work so that we could operate from it.<br /> <br /> That is all I got so far. What are you thoughts on them ?&quot;\u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-01T12:55:52-08:00","id":1504134,"title":"","content":"&quot;Um, sorry no, I'm not versed in Death...Nor Spirit. I have no experience with werewolves, and I'd prefer not to accidentally anger them. So, I'd prefer if we stick away from Stone Oak. As for Prospect Graveyard, I don't mind the spooks, but I definitely couldn't enter the Astral from there. I'd be too worried about Sleepers and ghosts messing with my body to enter. And with three gates, I can't imagine there is a shortage of ghosts in the cemetery.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I'm uncertain of Tesslin's Hollow. I think diving has problems, some of which could be mitigated by spells, but I'd prefer not to worry about drowning. Quarry lakes aren't exactly shallow, and while it's totally doable, any potential problems encountered could wind up being much worse than they would be otherwise. I'm also worried about what else might be down there. I've read stories of Hallows warping wildlife in strange ways, and while I doubt it's the case here, it could be possible. I'd need to look into it, maybe I could find a safer way to extract Tass, but it's certainly not my first choice.<br /> <br /> Given all of that, I think we should pick between Hyleen Cottage and the Njord's Draught. I believe those to be our best options. I would want to see the state of the cottage and meet Gil. I think that would help us decide between the two. I admit though, that based on the description, I favor the cottage, as a safe place to practice, experiment, and journey into the Astral, but it may prove in too much of a state of disrepair to work with.<br /> <br /> Want to take a look?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-01T16:15:15-08:00","id":1504142,"title":"","content":"&quot;Sounds good. I would like to meet Gil as well, and I am especially curious about what is creating the Hallow at the cottage. The graveyard has Avernian Gates, the Stone Oak is a Loci, Njord's Draught has Hedgegates. All of those possibly made it easier for the gathered ley line energy to form a Hallow. But I don't think a similar catalyst was mentioned for either the quarry or cottage.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-01T17:04:59-08:00","id":1504148,"title":"","content":"&quot;To the weathermobile!&quot; Cloudchaser exclames, popping to her feet. She grab her coat and heads for the door. &quot;I didn't see any cars, so I assume you walked? If so, we'll take my car. Which would you like to see first?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-01T17:18:06-08:00","id":1504151,"title":"","content":"Elpis grabs their satchel, and looks for the sink to put the the now empty mug.<br /> \u201cUh, when does Gil usually leave for the day? I worry we might get there after Gil leaves if we go to the cottage first.\u201d","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-01T17:32:05-08:00","id":1504153,"title":"","content":"&quot;Gil will have the place open 'til midnight. He closes on Mondays rather than lose custom from the weekend crowd. We'd need to get there before the dinner rush though, so...&quot; She checks her watch &quot;I'd say we have about four hours before the Draught would be too busy for us. It's about a ten minute drive to either place, and about the fifteen from one location to the other.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-01T17:40:37-08:00","id":1504155,"title":"","content":"\u201cI think that\u2019s plenty of time, so can we head to the cottage first?\u201d","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-01T17:54:07-08:00","id":1504156,"title":"","content":"Qaf gets his backpack and places his empty mug in the sink<br /> <br /> &quot;I think we could head to the cottage first then, we could get a much better look while we have sunlight. Sunday afternoon and night are busier, but pubs do most prep work at the start of the day, so things shouldn't be too hectic for Gil if we arrive before the rush.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 03-01-2023, 09:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-05T15:29:22-08:00","id":1504501,"title":"","content":"&quot;Cottage it is!&quot;<br /> <br /> ------- <div class=\"img_align_center_wrapper\"><img width=\"325\" height=\"238\" data-align=\"center\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://c8.alamy.com/comp/RWG2JW/abandoned-farm-house-in-winter-nr-barrow-bay-ontario-canada-RWG2JW.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://c8.alamy.com/comp/RWG2JW/abandoned-farm-house-in-winter-nr-barrow-bay-ontario-canada-RWG2JW.jpg\" data-thumb-url=\"https://c8.alamy.com/comp/RWG2JW/abandoned-farm-house-in-winter-nr-barrow-bay-ontario-canada-RWG2JW.jpg\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment align_center js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/></div><br /> <br /> A short drive later, you arrive at &quot;The Heights&quot;. Which is a very fancy name for a brace of outdated and steadily decaying neighborhoods on one of the hilly outskirts of Little Atlantis. The small house Cloudchaser parks her pickup in front of isn't visably collapsing, as some of it's neighbors are, but it's clearly been abandoned for quite a while.<br /> <br /> &quot;Not as depressing as Prospect Yard, I suppose, but it is a rather sobering microcosm in some ways&quot; Cloudchaser grimaces. &quot;Feel free to start poking around. I'll answer any questions you might have.<br /> <br /> As you exit the car, the faint prickle of active magic tickles at you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-05T16:09:38-08:00","id":1504508,"title":"","content":"&quot;<i>Looks like a nice place. Is that two chimneys? If I recall, that usually means multiple systems of heating in very old buildings. I wonder, which one of those is the Hallowed Hearth? The building is quite old in any case. Is there electricity hooked up? If not, maybe we can use a Node instead for any electrical devices. I suppose there might not be a Node, the Hallow is small, apparently. I shoul-&quot;<br /> </i><br /> Elpis looks up immediately at the sense of active magic.<br /> <br /> &quot;Hey, do you feel that? Is that coming from the house?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-06T07:08:59-08:00","id":1504588,"title":"","content":"<i>&quot;Looks nice and discrete. The structure is old, but solid, we definitely work with that. Two chimneys means that there are probably multiple rooms for people to sit around, and they are probably at a fair distance from the kitchen, since that normally produces heat. A top room with a vantage view, might be good for conducting rituals without getting in the way of people moving around. Well, the first step is figuring out what makes this Hallow tick, then we can start organizing repairs and getting some supplies....&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Qaf starts hearing the faint ticking of clockwork, then the sudden feeling of a thunderclap and the gears responding to it, something supernatural just happened nearby.<br /> <br /> &quot;Yeah, I felt that too. If everyone is okay with it, I want to take a closer look. Anything we should keep in mind in there ?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 03-06-2023, 10:51 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-06T15:17:18-08:00","id":1504657,"title":"","content":"Cloudchaser leans out the window and cocks her head as if listening to something. After a moment she grin, leaning casually against the steering wheel and pulling out her phone.<br /> <br /> &quot;Go right ahead. Poke around and let me know what you find - I'll be interested to see if the two of you are as observant as you look.&quot; Her grin widens at a text message &quot;Fair warning, the rest of Skywatch are laying odds on what you'll miss.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-06T15:59:47-08:00","id":1504668,"title":"","content":"&quot;Whatever it was, we don't know if its something that would stay in the area for long, might as well try to catch a glimpse and have an idea of what to look for&quot;<br /> <br /> Qaf starts making an Imago, first its outline and then filling it out with with circuits of Prime energy, building it allow him to see on all layers of Twilight at once. As his eyes adjust to the spell, he allow his Obrimos instincts to filter anything that stands out with Active Mage Sight.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-06T16:13:14-08:00","id":1504669,"title":"","content":"&quot;Oh. Alright, I'm going to prepare some Yantras. You use lightning stuff, right Qaf?&quot; <br /> <br /> &quot;<i>Wow, he's fast at this. I'll have to keep that in mind for the future.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Elpis starts digging in their satchel, pulling out a small chunk of fulgurite, a small novel titled &quot;the pilgrim&quot;, and a small makeup mirror. They sigh at a returning memory.<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>I remember, looking for any sign of something important that I was assured was there. Always wondered what I was missing. It was always hidden so cleverly. She'd love to hide something weird inside that building. Well, I guess we should start on the outside first.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Elpis get out and starts to walk over to Qaf, concentrating on a point inside their brow, letting inside the hidden lights just beyond normal sight.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-06T16:48:19-08:00","id":1504674,"title":"","content":"&quot;Yep, but don't worry, my Nimbus is not particularly dangerous. It just makes people more aware of their surroundings and react quicker.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-06T17:04:18-08:00","id":1504675,"title":"","content":"&quot;(ow!) Uh, ok. Yeah, you really do have that storm style going on. Uh, what did you cast? Checking on Ley Lines?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-06T17:23:29-08:00","id":1504677,"title":"","content":"&quot;An Unveiling of Prime, using its ability of uncovering truth truth to let me see anything in Twilight, although it won't tell me in which phase or what I am looking at. Since it could be something ephemeral, it could possibly leave before I used a mantra. A quick glance would tell us what to look for, or at least rule out one possibility&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-06T18:26:05-08:00","id":1504685,"title":"","content":"&quot;I will check the on resonance then. I might be able to spot the Hallow from out here.&quot;<br /> <br /> Elpis takes the novel and lays it open on a shadowy part of the car. Lifting up a page in one hand, and holding the mirror in the other, Elpis pictures the page as the land around them and the text as lines of power. Elpis aims the reflection of the sun to illuminate the backside of the page, revealing the text on the back of the page. They feel the Imago come together in their eyes. They take a moment to put their tools back in their bag and look up and around, taking in the land around them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-06T18:34:10-08:00","id":1504690,"title":"","content":"Qaf Sees:<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Under Mage Sight, several twisting flows of magic appear to surround the house.<br /> <br /> One is a pulsing latticework of deep purple shot through with faint silver filament. At a glance, it looks almost like a cage. Woven through it is a thorny current of emerald electricity - likely a separate spell, but without analysis it's impossible to tell if it was cast by the same person.<br /> <br /> At a glance, Twilight appears clear. From within the house, it's possible to make out the faint glow of a Hallow, although trying to pin down <i>where</i> in the house the glow is coming from is difficult.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Elpis Sees:<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Under Mage Sight, several twisting flows of magic appear to surround the house.<br /> <br /> One is a pulsing latticework of deep purple shot through with faint silver filament - the &quot;light&quot; it gives off seems to bend away from the three Mages, and makes Elpis think of dull lectures and rambling speeches. At a glance, it looks almost like a cage. Woven through it is a thorny current of emerald electricity - likely a separate spell, but without analysis it's impossible to tell if it was cast by the same person.<br /> <br /> From within the house, it's possible to make out the faint glow of a Hallow, although trying to pin down <i>where</i> in the house the glow is coming from is difficult.<br /> <br /> The Ley Lines in the area are weak, with a livid yellow line being the most prominent. It follows the path of the road, with small &quot;tributary&quot; fillaments arising from the houses. </div></div> </div> </div><br /> \u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-06T19:06:48-08:00","id":1504697,"title":"","content":"&quot;I see two spells. One of them looks like Arcadian magic, emeral thorns, with a distinct Aetherial element to it&quot;<br /> <br /> Turns to Cloudchaser &quot;So I suspect it was one of your spells, but I haven't studied it yet with the Focused Sight&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;The second one looks like a binding spell, formed into a cage. There is a bit of Arcadian magic to it, silver threads reinforcing it. Its purple, the colors of Arcadia and the Primal Wilds, but the way its put together doesn't feel like what a Thyrsus would favor, did Chevalier bind a spirit here ?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 03-06-2023, 10:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-06T19:20:41-08:00","id":1504704,"title":"","content":"&quot;Uh, I'd need to examine it closer, but I can see the cage, and it feels abnormally boring. I think it might be a spell to push away people's attention. Everyone in the area seems to be lightly feeling or doing the same thing, based on the ley line. Forms a stream right down the road.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>Morning traffic?&quot;</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-06T20:11:32-08:00","id":1504715,"title":"","content":"Cloudchaser taps her chin thoughtfully at the assessment. &quot;Well, you aren't wrong about the Arcadian and Aetheric elements. I didn't make either spell though, and Elpis is correct about the cage deflecting attention. It's a variation on the family of spells usually refered to as 'Incognito Presence' or 'Not-My-Problem Field'. Basically, the 'cage' is a Mind spell convincing everyone that what they see through it is so boring that it doesn't warrant any attention. We're unaffected because of the Key, which are the silver bits you're seeing. Care to take a guess at the emerald thorns, or would you like to study it a bit first?&quot;<br /> <br /> ----<br /> <br /> Looking closely, Elpis can see that the trails are indeed strongest coming from houses that are obviously occupied. The one extending from Hyleen Cottage is barely present, although it pulses somewhat stronger where it draws near any of you. Cloudchaser especially seems to trigger it when she looks directly at the house, or the other dilapidated domiciles.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-06T20:48:13-08:00","id":1504718,"title":"","content":"Elpis mutters as much to themselves as anyone lisneing<br /> &quot;...Lines of thorny current, warped around a building. Is it a cage, or...barbed wire? Something to greatly discourage those who poke too closely?&quot;<br /> Elpis nods to themself.<br /> &quot;I think it's another line of ward. What exactly it does, I don't know. I definitely need a closer look, but am I going to trigger it by examining it?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>So, we are adding to the current. I guess lowers the evidence for routine. It's something we are all doing right now, Cloudchaser especially. Observation? Curiosity? I need to hold that thought.&quot;</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-06T20:56:19-08:00","id":1504719,"title":"","content":"&quot;It's a security measure, but not preventive one, if that makes any sense. A ward, but not a Shielding.&quot; The capital 'S' is audible in Cloudchaser's voice.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-06T21:05:11-08:00","id":1504722,"title":"","content":"&quot;<i>Must not be harmful, otherwise she would have told me if it would hurt me.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Elpis starts to walk over to the building.<br /> <br /> &quot;Ok, I'm going to check it out.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-07T16:34:45-08:00","id":1504792,"title":"","content":"&quot;You will be looking at the effect using the Focused Prime Sight, right ? Since the spell has some Arcadian elements to it and the only Arcadian Arcanum I have is Time, I could use Time sight and hope it provides some extra information&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Its probably Fate, but Cloudchaser just said there is no harm in trying. I would rather take some percentage chance to get results, instead of the guarantee of nothing which comes with not trying&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Qaf pauses for a few moments, perceiving the nuances of Time does not come as intuitively to him <i>&quot;Remember the machinery in the city, the fractal clockwork is always there, every moment forged into gears and circuits of multi dimensional glass. Its always there, hidden beneath sight, focus....adjust your eyes to see the light they reflect upon your surroundings&quot;</i><br /> <br /> As his eyes start adjusting, he looks to see if Active Time Sight highlights anything <i>&quot;First lets see if there is some clarity to be sought before commiting&quot;</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 03-07-2023, 07:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-07T20:33:07-08:00","id":1504808,"title":"","content":"The spell does not react under Time Sight, any more than it did under Forces. Prime continues to register it as &quot;magic&quot;<br /> <br /> As the Mages draw closer, the emerald spell seems to &quot;pool&quot; around the latticework closest to them. It draws to mind a plasma ball toy that is being touched.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-10T14:05:19-08:00","id":1505043,"title":"","content":"&quot;No reaction on Time sight, nothing on Forces either, I think Prime is our safest bet. We could Focus on it and cross check what we learn&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" ta