Mandarin and the other images of the Four Auspicious Beasts. It looks hand made, the kanji and outline are gold colored and the inner sections are copper colored.<br /> <br /> <img title=\"image.png\" data-tempid=\"temp_1174_1678491891108_860\" data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=1174\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=1174\" data-thumb-url=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=1174&amp;type=thumb\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"image.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-need-data-att-update js-lightbox-participant\" itemprop=\"image\"/>\u200b<br /> <img data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/image/jpeg;base64,\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/image/jpeg;base64,\" data-thumb-url=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/image/jpeg;base64,&amp;type=thumb\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/><br /> <br /> &quot;No worries, I always have one on hand. I think it might be a good idea for me to drop True Sight and give our yantras a boost instead&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-st