one that connects them. They push wisps of connection along the connection to Qaf, helping interpret the symbolism he might encounter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-10T17:37:46-08:00","id":1505076,"title":"","content":"Qaf takes the book and coin, placing them both in the light. He look at his wristwatch, a pretty durable one, which has a small compass built in, and probably other helpful gadgets as well, a useful tool for a survivor. The hands of the watch, however, are ornate golden ones, looking like the hands of a grandfather clock or maybe stylized spears. He intones words in High Speech and points the clock to each of the items as he does so. But he Imago's circuitry is messy and burns out.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;That was poorly designed, it didn't interlock with the clockwork correctly. So maybe all I need to do is wait for the right moment to align the items with the spell ?&quot;</i><br /> <br /> He takes another moment to focus. He carefully aligns the items to match positions the clock hands will hit in a few seconds, when the clock enters the correct position, he speaks the High Speech interface command and the Imago executes neatly.<br /> <br /> &quot;They should be good to go now, it will last only a few moments, but more than enough to make a difference&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 03-11-2023, 06:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-13T18:22:43-07:00","id":1505270,"title":"","content":"Elpis blinks, feeling the Mystery clarify under their combined gaze.<br /> <br /> \u201d<i>He just tore through that Mystery like it was nothing. Ok, so it turns out to not have been that complicated, but still. Looks like it was a trip wire. And one that will fade soon. I wonder if this was taken into consideration when we were offered this place. \u2026That\u2019s quite the lovely nimbus, I\u2019ll have to examine it in more detail later.\u201d</i><br /> <br /> They head back to Cloudchaser.<br /> <br /> \u201dI think we figured it out. The second spell was set up to let someone who I think might have been of your cabal know if anyone living accessed the location. I think that\u2019s everything, unless Qaf spots something else. I hope we did well for your bet. May we enter?\u201d","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-13T18:54:44-07:00","id":1505275,"title":"","content":"<i>&quot;That worked out incredibly well, using a telepathic bond to boost that made things so much easier. What an impressive Nimbus, to have used their research to empower it so much, Elpis must be a person of deep commitment&quot;</i><br /> <br /> &quot;The only other information that I got was that it was not relinquished and that the Nimbus was like a powerful downpour, a storm that illuminated a dark forest with each lightning strike.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 03-13-2023, 10:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-13T22:37:39-07:00","id":1505286,"title":"","content":"&quot;Corrcetamundo. Well, mostly. It was cast by Zeus, one of the Hedgemarshals in the Iron Star Cabal. He cast and relinquished the anti-perception cage as part of a... penance... that he's serving for the Council. The Life-tripwire is also part of the punishment detail, but he's relieved of that duty if you take custodianship of this place. 'Course, that means you'd have to arrange your own defenses, beyond the cage.&quot;<br /> <br /> Cloudchaser clambers out of the vehicle, sending off a final text.<br /> <br /> &quot;OK! Zeus is forewarded! Now that we don't need to worry about a panicked Arrow... Lead on! You're doing well on the bet, we'll see how you stick the landing.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-14T12:31:02-07:00","id":1505357,"title":"","content":"\u201cAlright, then\u201d <br /> \u201c<i>Wait, there is more to the bet? Best be on the lookout I suppose.\u201d</i><br /> Elpis goes to the door, and enters the building.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-17T23:46:35-07:00","id":1505641,"title":"","content":"The inside of the building is unkempt, nearly devoid of furniture, and prevaded by a scent that can only be described as &quot;animal&quot;. Just past the front door opens into one large room, with a fireplace built into oppoaing outer walls. One side holds sun-bleached marks where couches and chairs once sat, the other side has a few dusty bookshelves sparsely populated by mouse-nibbled books.<br /> <br /> Another door directly across from tbe front door opens into what appears to be a combined dining room and kitchen.<br /> <br /> With Mage Sight still up, you can see the Hallow. It is a ghostly, wavering glow, erratically flickering between the two fireplaces.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-18T09:15:53-07:00","id":1505681,"title":"","content":"<i>&quot;Given this place's size and the fact an Arrow was securing it, it makes no tactical sense that whatever he was supposed to defend would be found on the ground floor, intruders could breach and have immediate visual on the target. Zeus would probably keep whatever it is on the attic. A window to have visibility on intruders and act as an exit point if teleportation is blocked, diminishing the number of mundane entrance points. Nothing pinged so far on this level, but we might as well sanity check it&quot;</i><br /> <br /> &quot;So far nothing on this floor, besides the Hallow, stands out in Mage Sight. Since Zeus is supposed to guard something here, then that windowed room on the second floor, probably an attic, is easier to defend, so chances are that its there. I am going to take a look on this floor for any clues on whatever is being guarded here&quot;<br /> <br /> Qaf pulls his focus back to mundane reality, the elements of the glass machinery compositing themselves back into the scene. He begins meticulously searching the floor.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 03-18-2023, 03:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-18T17:38:29-07:00","id":1505726,"title":"","content":"Qaf's search turns up little beyond mouse droppings and grit, until he arrives at the bookshelves. Most of the remaining tomes are barely legible novels, but the top shelf of a sturdily made oak case holds a single slim notebook. It stands out when noticed, seeming newly made, hand-crafted, and untouched by the elements in contrast to the rest of the room. A faint prickling needles at Qaf as he notices the book - as if his Periphery was being alerted, but the offending effect ending too quickly to give him a proper ping.<br /> <br /> Elpis' assessment of the Hallows reveals a quick slew of information - it is weak, the bare minimum of Supernal bleed-through that the Mysterium clinically refers to as a &quot;Rank One Hallow&quot;. More interestingly, it seems to occupy both fireplaces simultaneously, the &quot;spark&quot; of it constantly jumping between the two points. A moment of watching this flickering with the aid of Forces Mage Sight seems to imply that the Hallow &quot;settles&quot; in pockets of heat, implying that a stoked fire in either -or perhaps both- of the fire places would stabilize it as an Oblation for any Mages in the large room.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-18T17:45:23-07:00","id":1505729,"title":"","content":"&quot;I just sensed magic, was that you ? I found a notebook that looks new and well kept&quot;. Qaf waits to confirm Elpis's answer before considering touching the book.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-18T18:21:34-07:00","id":1505736,"title":"","content":"\u201cYep, just checking the Hallow. Wanted to confirm what Cloudchaser has said about it. It\u2019s faint, only just here. It\u2019s flitting here and there, I think it might be able to stabilized though. Pretty much checks out what Cloudchaser told us. Haven\u2019t figured out what the Tass coalesces into yet. Maybe the answer is in the book you just found?\u201d","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-18T18:43:52-07:00","id":1505740,"title":"","content":"Qaf brings the book back for them to examine &quot;Lets take a look&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-18T18:51:08-07:00","id":1505741,"title":"","content":"The book is oddly warm to the touch, bound in a sheath pale leather and kept closed by a thin silver chain. The pages seem well-formed and even, with little in the way of tears or ridges. Across the sheath is inked geometric patterns that somewhat resemble astrological symbology, and a line of unintelligible runes occupies where one would typically expect to see a title;<br /> <br /> \u2a33\u1962\u0248 \u0e04\u0248 \u1545\u1962\u0e2f \u0e26\u0e2f\u1570\u1d0e\u1a7f\u0e26\ud83d\udf65 \u15bd\u0e2f\u0e04\u0e26\u2982\u1570\u097d, \u2a33\u1962\u0248 \u0e04\u0248 \u1d0e\u1a7f\ud801\udc52\u0e2f\u1570\u2982\u0e4f\u1570\u097d\u0e26 \u0e4f\u1d0e\u1a7f\u0a1f\u030a\u1570. \u2a33\u1545\u1962\ud801\udc52\u14ed\u0e26 \u0e04\u0248 \u2a33\u1570 \u1d0e\u1a7f\u0e2f\u2982\u1545\u15bd \u1545\u2644 \u0e26\u0e04\u0e4f\u1570, \u0e4f\u1570\u0e4f\u1545\u0e2f\ud83d\udf65 \u097d\u1570\ud83d\udf6a\u1570\u0e2f \u2644\u1d0e\u1a7f\u0a1f\u030a\u1570\u0248.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":27258,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","user":"Cauthon","date":". 03-20-2023, 12:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-19T14:12:24-07:00","id":1505813,"title":"","content":"\u201cOh hey\u2026Wow! This is a great find! I don\u2019t immediately recognize the symbols though. Do you mind if I take some time with this? The Mysterium has many techniques to reveal obscured meaning, and my knowledge of Prime and Mind could accelerate the process further. Though, I suppose there might be more pieces of the puzzle hidden around the house.\u201d","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-19T15:24:29-07:00","id":1505829,"title":"","content":"Cloudchaser leans around Elpis, the short woman craning her neck to study the book quizzically.<br /> <br /> &quot;I doubt it's Zeus'. The boy is... illiterate would be an overstatement, but he definitely fulfills the 'jock' stereotype. I can't say I recognize the symbols either.&quot; Her brow furrows at that. She seems to be arguing with herself for a moment, but finally shakes her head.<br /> <br /> &quot;Tell you what, this is your first proper assignment as a Cabal of grown-up Mages - figure out this book. I may take it off your hands at a later date, but for now it seems harmless enough. There's a slight temporal displacement on it, but that's fading fast. The previous residents were part of the Ladder, so that Caucus might have better data than the Consilium or Mysterium records.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-19T15:28:44-07:00","id":1505830,"title":"","content":"&quot;In that case, I will take a quick look with Time sight. The Arrow gave me detective training, especially in pattern recognition, so if you are okay with it, I could lend a hand with the decryption afterwards&quot;<br /> <br /> Qaf starts focusing his awareness back on the currents of time<br /> <br /> &quot;Could I ask you to bless the coin ? Time sight takes me a bit more focus to activate&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 03-19-2023, 06:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-19T16:22:46-07:00","id":1505834,"title":"","content":"\u201cYes, of course\u2026do you mind if it gets a bit wet? It\u2019s metal so it should be fine, especially if I dry it.\u201d<br /> Elpis looks around for a sink, or somewhere where water can be poured without making a mess.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-19T16:23:48-07:00","id":1505835,"title":"","content":"&quot;No problem, go ahead&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-19T16:27:54-07:00","id":1505837,"title":"","content":"Elpis spots a sink through the doorway into the kitchen. Decrepit, but still structurally sound.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-19T17:52:47-07:00","id":1505853,"title":"","content":"&quot;Ok, I'm closing the door so I don't disturb y'all&quot;<br /> <br /> Elpis closes the door and pulls out the phial from their bag. The container still glimmers with starlight, as it has for years now. They hold the coin out over the sink, and begin humming an old favored tune. They pour some of the Water from the phial onto the coin, imaging the starlight was away any impurities, leaving behind its idealized image. But it does not shine from within. They frown and concentrate even harder on the image until the starlight seems to infuse the coin as much as the water. For the briefest of moments, the room seems to spin, before snapping back to reality.<br /> <br /> &quot;Ok, I'm done.&quot; <br /> <br /> Elpis opens the door and offers the coin to Qaf.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-19T18:44:31-07:00","id":1505857,"title":"","content":"Qaf focuses on the book, filtering the images through the coin, but too many layers of glass mechanisms are overlayered for him to parse out.<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>That was too much at once, focus, separate the essential components from the rest&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Qaf tries once more, but he still struggles to parse through the visual overload<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Maybe I need to instead focus on how the layers connect, rather than on the pieces&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Qaf attempts to look at the points the gears connect, but it provides no more clarity. Instead, he starts seeing sparks of electricity appear sometimes, like the results of static being released.<br /> <br /> &quot;I can't make heads or tails of it, but if I keep going, my Nimbus will build up enough of a charge that random sparks will start getting in the way&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-19T19:52:18-07:00","id":1505866,"title":"","content":"Removed<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Cloudchaser's lips tighten slightly, but she just shrugs. &quot;Well, the resonance is gone now at any rate. It looked like a Temporal Stutter, the book might have been displaced and only just returned. I'll leave the investigating to you two. In the mean time... kitchen, second floor, and then off to the Draught. Stairs should be in the kitchen, just to the left of the door&quot;</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":27258,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","user":"Cauthon","date":". 03-19-2023, 11:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-19T19:56:27-07:00","id":1505868,"title":"","content":"&quot;Hmm. I noticed the book is in remarkably good condition, especially when compared to the rest of the building. I suspect it might be preserved from entropy in some way. Could you check how long this book has existed while I prepare to decrypt it?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-20T09:28:10-07:00","id":1505907,"title":"","content":"&quot;Sure thing. What we need is a temporal indexing spell, okay, I'll give it a shot&quot;<br /> <br /> Qaf starts looking at the clock, intoning High Speech to the rhythm of its motion, the Imago coming together as it finds the book's position on the temporal axis.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;What the ? The Knowing spell had trouble parsing tbe exact time it was created ?&quot;</i><br /> <br /> &quot;This book was created on May 28th, 1933. But of those 90 years, its 70 younger than it should be, because it didn't exist in the timeline for a while. The Occam's Razor explanation would be that it was under a <i>Temporal Stutter</i>, or something close enough to that. The Knowing spell couldn't figure out the exact time it was made, instead it said, hold on....&quot;<br /> <br /> Qaf reaches into one of the external pockets of his backpack, pulling out a notepad and pen. He writes down a name, which looks like \u0e40\u0e45\u0e40\u0e45<br /> <br /> \u200b&quot;This. I am not familiar with this language, however, in the words of Doctor Strange...&quot;<br /> <br /> Qaf pulls his smartphone from his pocket, activates the translate from picture app, sets it to detect language and takes a picture of the note.<br /> <br /> &quot;...I am fluent in Google Translate&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 03-20-2023, 05:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-20T15:17:17-07:00","id":1505948,"title":"","content":"Qaf's screen glitches slightly around the symbols, pixels distorting as if unwilling to process them. Google Translate simply cannot -or refuses to- register them as a language.<br /> <br /> Cloudchaser's frown deepens. &quot;I don't recognize them, but stylistically those look similar to the cover of the book...&quot; <br /> <br /> Her fingers twitch involuntarily, and she licks her lips.<br /> <br /> &quot;Look, kids, I'm trying very hard to not snatching that from you. Us oldsters shouldn't hoard all the mysteries for ourselves, not if we want competent peers. But the longer we spend looking at it, the more I'm going to want to take over.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-20T15:39:13-07:00","id":1505953,"title":"","content":"<i>&quot;Wait a second, wait a second. I heard about this stuff. Weren't things from Atlantean ruins supposed to be like this ? Spells turning up weird information, technology simply failing to work on this stuff, isn't that how it goes ? I might be overthinking it, Elpis probably has a way to know for sure. Lets see if they think we can still push a little farther&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Qaf waits to see what Elpis wants to do","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-20T15:58:07-07:00","id":1505958,"title":"","content":"\u201c<i>Huh, that\u2019s weird. Maybe it\u2019s outside of the programs parameters, I should double check-\u201c</i><br /> <br /> Elpis happens to look At Cloudchaser\u2019s body language and recognizes it immediately. <br /> <br /> \u201cUh, we are on something of a schedule. Let\u2019s put a pin in this for now, and finish figuring it out later. Does that sound good?\u201d<br /> <br /> Elpis looks somewhat pleadingly at Qaf for help.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-20T16:03:23-07:00","id":1505960,"title":"","content":"&quot;Yeah, sounds good. We will have plenty of time later, but we need to finish looking around and get to the Draught before its packed. Shall we go take a look upstairs ?&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Elpis managed to get a last minute save. So far, so good. We even managed to find an interesting Mystery for later.&quot;</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-