"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-20T16:10:46-07:00","id":1505962,"title":"","content":"Cloudchaser nods vigorously, practically bolting for the kitchen door. &quot;Stairs should be in the kitchen, just to the left of the door&quot;<br /> <br /> The kitchen itself is not much to be remarked on, just outdated -and likely broken- appliances that look to be from the fifties. Technically the space is a combined kitchen and dining room, with a bar-island separating the two. The dining area, to the left as you enter, also has a flight of stairs leading up towards the second floor. Cloudchaser hurries up the stairs, not pausing to see if the others follow.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-20T16:25:58-07:00","id":1505967,"title":"","content":"Elpis looks up the stairs, and takes a moment to breathe.<br /> <br /> \u201dSorry. I\u2026uh panicked a little. She was just like that before\u2026\u201d <br /> <br /> Words seem to fail them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-20T17:00:13-07:00","id":1505969,"title":"","content":"&quot;Don't worry about it. I'm glad we could redirect her focus, the Obsession in her eyes was almost tangible. We might have been able to get away with one of us staying back to study it. But since both the spell and app glitched, I figured its either from the Time Before or Abyssal. I have a theory on how to use Prime to check for Abyssal influence, but its untested. But if we did and its not Abyssal, we would be tempting her to yoink it. If we didn't, then chances are one of us would be left with an Intruder. Didn't like those odds, I couldn't say anything out loud either, but you came through with the last minute save&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakeni