ar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-24T17:13:35-07:00","id":1506382,"title":"","content":"&quot;I think we agree then. Alright, would you like to move on to Njord's Draught? I think we have seen enough here to make an informed decision.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-24T17:21:52-07:00","id":1506385,"title":"","content":"&quot;Let's roll.&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;I wonder how we did on the bet&quot;</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 03-24-2023, 10:56 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-26T04:46:44-07:00","id":1506469,"title":"","content":"Cloudchaser nods, suppressing a slight grin.<br /> &quot;Well, that's good to hear. Zephyr and Sicorro will certainly be glad to hear their faith in you was warranted, Qaf. You two found the interesting things in the building, and even dissected a good chunk of the local spellwork. I'll give you an A-. Now, back to the car!&quot;<br /> <br /> -----<br /> <br /> A short drive later, the pickup rolls to a stop in the parking lot of a wide two-story building. The walls appear to be log, with long tinted windows situated just a bit too high to easily be broken into. A swinging wooden sign hangs above the door, carved on both sides with a stylized, bearded figure draining a tankard. Cloudchaser leads the group inside, whistling what might be a sea shanty as she goes.<br /> <br /> The interior is slightly jarring, a mishmash of design styles. The main sitting area is done up in dark wood and deep cushons, mainly booths surrounding a trio of well-maintained pool tables. A thick carpet covers the floor, the tight weave sure to repel the worst crumbs and drink stains into its dark dye.<br /> <br /> The bar area, on the other hand, is done up in an industrial design. Steel chairs and pleather seats, mirror-polished obsidian countertop, and a looming cement wall behind glass shelves of alcohol. Interestingly, the cement has been recently spray-painted, and the shelves look easy to remove.<br /> <br /> A door on one side of the cement wall appears to lead back to the kitchen, while a staircase on the opposite side appears to lead to the second story.<br /> <br /> Though a small sign in the front door read &quot;closed&quot;, the room is quite full. Two uncomfortable-looking men stand behind the bar, while two women and three men stand glaring at one-another around the pool tables. Cloudchaser looks surprised to see the cluster, her brow furrowing in concern.<br /> <br /> &quot;<a href=\"https://cdnb.artstation.com/p/assets/images/images/054/807/607/large/rinotuna-.jpg?1665425650\" target=\"_blank\">Hiawatha</a>, <a href=\"https://i.pinimg.com/736x/6f/d8/5e/6fd85e417a52ab71edff5a832d37b9b0.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">Sunshine</a>, <a href=\"https://i.pinimg.com/originals/44/48/88/4448884e3e2f4bb9b4b475536bd891be.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">Watchtower</a>. Perhaps you could introduce your two friends?&quot;<br /> <br /> The three named -all Mages that Qaf and Elpis have at least met in passing- jump slightly, and make polite bows and nods to the Hierophant. Hiawatha quickly takes charge, gliding diffidently to her side while shooting a quizzical glance at Qaf and Elpis.<br /> <br /> &quot;Hierophant Cloudchaser, these are Lictor <a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/watchdogscombined/images/e/e4/AidenRender.png/revision/latest?cb=20140416182135\" target=\"_blank\">Cynosure</a> and Voter <a href=\"https://external-preview.redd.it/xI5ndFNHd7R6xixPdFS7hP1WVTNPzNKBWoD6UK1ep2k.jpg?auto=webp&amp;s=390ab221b604e42666a030602bc802174f3032aa\" target=\"_blank\">Ferdiad</a>, of the White Sands Consilium. They've come to... discuss the state of affairs in their jurisdiction with the Hierarch. We also called the other Councilors, but the Hierarch said we didn't need to worry about you. I think I can guess why, now.&quot;<br /> <br /> Cloudchaser immediately sobers, her expression going hard as she studies the two out-of-towners. After a moment, she grimaces and heads towards the stairs.<br /> <br /> &quot;Well, we may as well get comfortable then. Gil!&quot; <a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mrfz/images/c/cf/Ethan_Skin_1.png/revision/latest?cb=20201214010525\" target=\"_blank\">The shorter of the two men</a> behind the bar jumps in surprise. &quot;We'll be taking over the private dining room on the north side, to keep out of your hair. Eplis and Qaf there are the prospective investors we discussed, I'd appreciate you and <a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?client=ms-android-samsung-gn-rev1&amp;sxsrf=APwXEdevokQVM-zg4osq6GER2-d6wQMvPw:1679831092782&amp;q=arknights+jaye&amp;tbm=isch&amp;sa=X&amp;ved=2ahUKEwiSosW8wvn9AhVBLX0KHTNLCOQQ0pQJegQIDRAB&amp;biw=360&amp;bih=598&amp;dpr=3#imgrc=7hiMOOFasZEz6M&amp;imgdii=EocRG8pxLH7kkM&amp;lnspr=W10=\" target=\"_blank\">Jaye</a> giving them the elevator pitch. Qaf, Elpis, please stay down here until I come get you. The rest of you, upstairs. Now.&quot;<br /> <br /> The other mages quickly file after her. Watchtower nods soberly to Elpis - the Sentinel has tried to be friendly in the past, but is obviously not adept at it even without having been the bearer of bad news. Oddly, Voter Ferdiad stares intently at Elpis as he ascends the stairs, to the point that he stumbles as he reaches the landing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":27258,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","user":"Cauthon","date":". 03-26-2023, 08:12 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-26T14:59:17-07:00","id":1506536,"title":"","content":"&quot;<i>Wow, this place has quite interesting design choices. Kinda wish I had been in more pubs before, so I could compar-Oh, it's quite crowded in here...wait is that Watchtower?...Oh.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Elpis stops for a moment and unconsciously begins to hold one arm with the other. They look away from everyone, trying to focus on the words.<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>What's going on? A Lictor and a Voter? </i>\u200b<i>All the way from White Sands? Isn't that in Nevada? No No, New Mexico. Way way too far for a casual visit, which means they have important matters to discuss. The presence of A Lictor means that there is a lot of legal stuff involved. With Watchtower, Sunshine, and Hiawatha?... They're going to talk about what happened to Pandora, aren't they? &quot;</i><br /> <br /> They snap out of their self-absorption and nod to Cloundchaser's command. They watch the procession leave, hesitantly nodding back to Watchtower. They lock eyes with Voter Ferdiad, only to immediately turn their gaze away. They turn back towards the stairs when they are sure everyone has gone.<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>Wha-what was that about? No, doesn't matter. If they are going to be discussing what happened to Pandora, I-I need to know what they are saying. How? I can't exactly stand at the stairs and listen in, everyone down here would notice. Enhance my hearing? Yeah, and have my ears bleed when someone down here speaks. Not to mention Qaf would notice the spell. Maybe even Gil would notice. Can I even get away with a spell while we have a meeting? Even if I can fork my mind, I'm sure everyone would notice.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> A slight pain starts to build in their forehead.<br /> <br /> &quot; <i>Heck</i>, <i>I'm so tired, I don't even know if I can properly form the Imago for a spell. This is so frustrating, I could scream. Some of the answers I need are just a few meters away, and I'm can only watch as they slip away from me...No! There has to be some way for me to get to them....wait, Qaf knows Time! He could look into the past and see that conversation. Would that trigger anyone's Mage Sight? ...I don't think so?&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Elpis sighs.<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>That's going to have to be good enough for now...I shouldn't keep Gil and Jaye waiting anymore.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Elpis turns around and tries a smile.<br /> <br /> &quot;Hello, My Name is Elpis, and this is Qaf.&quot;<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":26736,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","user":"TempleBuilder","date":". 03-26-2023, 06:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-26T15:43:56-07:00","id":1506540,"title":"","content":"Gil ceases his worried staring at the stairs, turning a friendly -if somewhat forced- smile towards the two. He's surprisingly short - if not for the small goatee, he'd be easily mistaken for a child.<br /> <br /> &quot;Welcome, welcome! Not the best introduction, but we'll make do with what we've got. I'm Ethan Gilligan, but you can just call me Gil. The big man is Jaye.&quot; Gil's voice is slightly nasal, enough to be distinctive but falling just short of annoying. He gently elbows the taller man, who hasn't stopped watching the stairs. Though intimidatingly stoic at first glance, closer inspection implies that Jaye's just not very expressive. He bobs his head in greeting, mumbling an awkward platitude.<br /> <br /> &quot;Can we get you anything, while we talk? Jaye's a virtuoso with seafood, and I'm not a bad hand with a tumbler.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-26T16:16:00-07:00","id":1506542,"title":"","content":"<i>&quot;So that was Watchtower, the Guardian that brought news of Pandora ?&quot;</i> Qaf sees Elpis hold one arm in another &quot;<i>Yeah, no doubt about it, holding an arm in another to make a barrier, means a person is feeling defensive, what's more, its both arms. They came from New Mexico ? That is quite a distance away, meeting in private room of a well defended bar, with little information available about the meeting and with the presence of a Lictor ? This is very high profile stuff, if they even need a specialist on the Lex Magicka.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Qaf sees the exchange with Ferdiad <i>&quot;The odd one out in this case is the Voter, but he was dedicating all his focus to Elpis, to the point where he dropped his awareness of the meeting and even his surroundings. Whatever Pandora did, he has an emotional stake in it&quot;</i><br /> <br /> He then sees the aftermath. <i>&quot;So you want to know what is going on and are not playing it close to the vest, understandable. I have a feeling it will come back to you regardless, if Ferdiad is so invested&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Qaf gives Gil and Jaye a smile<br /> <br /> &quot;Nice to meet you both. Some seafood sounds great, what do you recommend ?&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;A sigh ? Did you give up ? There is one possible way you could listen in, you caught on pretty quickly last time, lets see if I can drop a hint discretely&quot;</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 03-26-2023, 07:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-26T17:04:42-07:00","id":1506547,"title":"","content":"Jaye squints appraisingly for a moment, then nods to himself. &quot;Calamari.&quot;<br /> <br /> Without waiting for a reply he strides off to the kitchens. There's a few moments of chopping and sizzling, then he re-emerges bearing a steaming plate of crisply battered rings and sliced lemons. The scent of garlic butter rises from a small dipping bowl situated in the center of the plate, and he sets two pairs of chopsticks before the Mages. Gil's smile becomes a genuine grin.<br /> <br /> &quot;Neat little party trick, that. Brownie's Boon, we often call it - get a job done in a fraction of the time.<br /> <br /> &quot;Now then... elevator pitch. I don't claim to understand how your mage-y stuff works any more than you lot understand how our Contracts work, you understand. But I know there's a spot in the storeroom downstairs that makes beer y'all go nuts for. Your bosses help keep us in the black, and the Iron Star lot manage security, in exchange for access to those bottles. <br /> <br /> &quot;That being said, we aren't the main priority for the Stars. It's mostly just them using whatever <i>wasta</i> they have with the cops to get us favorable treatment, and they'll sling spells for us pro-bono if we ask. The scary meteorologist upstairs said you two might be willing to make a more... personal arrangement with us in exchange for more intimate access to our brew.<br /> <br /> &quot;The Stars tell me I'm only using about half the potential of the... Hallow? downstairs, and that the excess could be easily skimmed with magic without diminishing &quot;tass&quot; production. In exchange for exclusive siphoning rights, plus the use of the various bolt-holes we have set up here, I'd ask for you to contribute to our defenses and maybe help with the odd job around the building. I'm open to negotiations, of course - let it never be said that the Trader Courts are too bull headed to make a deal!&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-26T17:45:31-07:00","id":1506558,"title":"","content":"<i>&quot;Blast, I did not count on his insane speed. I should be angry, but calamari rings are one of my all time favorites, and it smells amazing too. Hold on, you can salvage this Qaf, let's pivot&quot;</i><br /> <br /> &quot;Beer tass sounds pretty interesting, what kind of defenses are you looking for ? Anything you would want us to focus on ? Actually, before that, could you please point us to the bathroom ? The calamari rings were such a good call, but we were in a pretty dusty place beforehand and I think it would be a good idea to wash our hands first.&quot; Looks over to Elpis &quot;You could go first, if you wish, while we do an overview.&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Peripheral Mage Sight only pings inside the same room, or within sensory range. This way you have a private place and a few moments to cast whatever, and I have the plausible deniability of being nowhere nearby to point out the spells. What those spells are and if you are willing to risk if some here has Active Sight is up to you to figure out. That is the most discrete way I can provide an opportunity right now, lets see what you make of it&quot;</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 03-26-2023, 08:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-26T17:53:26-07:00","id":1506560,"title":"","content":"&quot;<i>Oh, wow! That must be amazingly useful to have stuff done in a flash. Can Qaf do that? No no, ask later. Wait, huh? Oh, that is a good point. I should clean up.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> <i>&quot;</i>Oh, yeah ok. Could I also get a glass of water?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>It's probably not polite to drink from a water bottle in a pub.&quot;</i>\u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-26T18:12:37-07:00","id":1506563,"title":"","content":"&quot;There's one on the second floor, first door on the left. Bur if you'd prefer to avoid the... tensions upstairs, Jaye can show you where the staff bathroom is through the kitchen.&quot; Gil starts puttering about the bar, hopping down off the stool he's been standing on. Two glasses of clear liquid soon appear on beside the plate, the rims decorated with cucumber and orange slices.<br /> <br /> &quot;As for the tass, we sell that to you wiz-kids at a slight markup. For a bit more -or just a flat fee, if you bring your own bottles- we'll get any drink you want infused. Just ask for the 'special reserve', and we'll get you set up.<br /> <br /> &quot;I know you lot have different skills, which is very much in our favor when it comes to defenses. Without going too much into what it means to be a Changeling, the more unpredictable we can be the better. I'd love to see passive stuff like troublemakers overlooking our establishment, but intelligence-gather like divinations on how buisness will look each night -or week!- wouldn't be unappreciated. Whatever you can add to our own skills, we'd appreciate it.&quot;<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-26T18:22:46-07:00","id":1506565,"title":"","content":"Elpis nods and tries for a smile. <br /> <br /> &quot;That would be most kind, I don't think they would appreciate me intruding.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-26T19:02:22-07:00","id":1506572,"title":"","content":"Jaye nods, leading Elpis back through the kitchen. It's clean, if a little cramped, with a (locked) double-door to the outside along the back wall and what appears to be an elevator adjacent to where the staircase is in the main room. A small hallway beside that leads to a staff restroom - again, qell-maintained but short on elbow room.<br /> <br /> Jaye leans against a counter, idly checking on a pot of some fragrant liquid. &quot;I'll wait out here. If you need anything, just yell.&quot;<br /> ---<br /> <br /> In the main room, the front door swings open again. Santiago has changed from his paint-splattered overalls into a tightly tailored suit, his crimson shirt drawing the eye sharply to the gold compass rose tie clip securing his black tie. Beside him slouches <a href=\"https://rinotuna.artstation.com/projects/yJ0l03\" target=\"_blank\">Dantes</a>, the Adamant Sage looking more exhausted than usual. Though they walk in the same direction, towards the stairs, it's very obvious they aren't <i>together</i>. The two have never gotten along in anything more than a professional capacity.<br /> <br /> Santiago nods brusquely to Qaf and Gil, not slowing a stride. Dantes hesitates a moment before flicking a simple Arrow handsign to Qaf, one of the first new Arrows learn. &quot;<i>Possible enemies, rally if I signal&quot;</i><br /> <br /> The door barely has time to close before it bangs open again, ushering in <a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/pin/676877018994103345/?source=samsung_camera&amp;oe=1\" target=\"_blank\">Nighthawk</a> and <a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?client=ms-android-samsung-gn-rev1&amp;sxsrf=APwXEdfCFQTyAyt1xuo_3Np2RXTx05cz-g:1679881892913&amp;q=rinotuna+weather+man&amp;tbm=isch&amp;sa=X&amp;ved=2ahUKEwicivfb__r9AhXrBTQIHb-mCgoQ0pQJegQIFhAB&amp;biw=360&amp;bih=598&amp;dpr=3#imgrc=E-XP9vFkOLUUwM\" target=\"_blank\">Clean Sweep</a>. Nighthawk barely spares Qaf and Gil a glance before resuming a rapid-fire conversation in a foreign language on her phone, while Clean Sweep gives a polite wave. The Silver Ladder councilor looks quite odd, wearing shorts and flip-flops in the middle of winter. Only the gravity of the situation keeps it from being humorous; the Council has been assembled.<br /> <br /> The sight of all four senior mages immediately twigs Qaf's Peripheral Mage Sight, but Nighthawk and Clean Sweep in particular are sending it haywire. Either they have a few <i>very</i> powerful spells going, or they have a <i>lot</i> of mid-level spells going.<br /> <br /> &quot;By the <i>Bargain,</i> do you lot get ornery with each other.&quot; Gil mutters, peeking over the countertop. &quot;If I was out to harvest Glamour they'd be a buffet.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":27258,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","user":"Cauthon","date":". 03-26-2023, 10:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-26T19:57:32-07:00","id":1506588,"title":"","content":"<i>&quot;Putting spells up now would be too big a tell. Worst comes to worse, I will Shield both of us and start preparing to immobilize the hostiles. Bargain is probably one of those Contracts. But Glamour ? Might as well ask&quot;</i><br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;The tensions of politics, as fierce a battlefield as any. Glamour, I am not familiar with that term, and you mentioned gaining it by harvesting the palpable tension of the room, sounded similar to spirits, is it something along those lines ?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 03-26-2023, 11:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-26T21:02:01-07:00","id":1506603,"title":"","content":"Gil clambers back onto his stool, eyeing Qaf.<br /> <br /> &quot;Spirits... Can't say I know much about them, so I won't feed you bad information by saying yeh or nay. Near as I can figure, it's to us what that 'tass' stuff is to you. We can harvest it safely from strong emotional events, or we can rip it directly from a victim. We try to avoid that second one, it deaden their emotions for a while. Glamour allows us to use some of our trickier skills, like Jaye's Brownie Boon.&quot;<br /> <br /> His eyebrows raise suggestively. &quot;The way the Stars talk, some of you can facilitate the process. Set up the emotional events, or even harvest Glamour if you're skilled. Those would be <i>very </i>useful, if you or the other one can manage it.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":27258,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","user":"Cauthon","date":". 03-27-2023, 12:15 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-26T21:15:18-07:00","id":1506606,"title":"","content":"Elpis nods.<br /> <br /> &quot;Thank you very much.&quot;<br /> <br /> Elpis begin to wash their hands and check their hair. They pause when they hear foots steps above.<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>Wait a second. I'm alone, and almost right below everyone. If I wait here, I could probably hear most of the conversation, if a bit muffled. No, can't do that, that would be suspicious, and I shouldn't leave Qaf on his own. What If I left a spell? I don't think anyone would feel it from down here. Even if it's not perfect, I can replay the memory later as many times as it takes. But it's going to be distracting during our negotiation...I'm going to need to fork my mind. Well, that's not too difficult. Can't waste any more time.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Elpis tries to dry their hands as quietly as possible, but leaves the water on. They look into their bag and pull out the novel. They put their finger on the mirror, feeling the micro-vibrations of the sound of talking and people walking, They feel the vibrations more subtly in the book as well. They look into the mirror and imagine that the vibrations make a field. They imagine trying to put the novel in that field, but it seems to act much like a magnet of the same polarity, slipping around. They try again and again, only for the book to slip out from it again and again. with each attempt, their headache grows. On their fourth attempt, they try to carefully guide the book, letting the field go through the book, instead of around it. The book finally touches the surface of the mirror, and suddenly Elpis can hear as though their ear was pressed against the wall of the bathroom. They sigh, letting some of the growing tension out. They look back into the mirror, and into their reflection. They take a strand of hair and place it between their eyes and the mirror, dividing their reflection in two. They then pose as if they were singing at home. They feel their attention that was torn between the meeting and the conversation, relax and divide. They continue to listen through the mirror as they finish up. They pause and check the time on their phone before opening the door.<br /> <br /> &quot;Ok, I'm ready to go back now.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-27T09:28:58-07:00","id":1506632,"title":"","content":"<i>&quot;Well that was a straightforward answer, I appreciate that. I have no idea what the effects of those emotional highs would have on Sleepers. Plus Elpis mentioned that Pandora was acting very erratic in the end. So even if it is harmless, I think they would not like the idea. If I condone it or if either of us bring it up, we will end up shooting ourselves in the foot. So I would rather do us both a good turn by steering us away from the minefield&quot;</i><br /> <br /> &quot;That is outside of the magic I know. Divination is, however, something I am very familiar with, so no problems there. Another thing that we could do is warding, which would make it very difficult for a specific being to enter. Like we could make the ghost of a famous arsonist not able to enter, but not all ghosts, but we could ward against a specific spirit and so on. As a general baseline, if its a being that normally has to obey certain rules or have its powers shut down, like &quot;cannot cross running water&quot;, then with some research we probably could make something to keep them away. If we have everything in place, I think it could all be done between 15 minutes and an hour, depending on the rush, and would last at least a day. Talismans are another option, those are much quicker to make, and can be fine tuned to work for one specific purpose. So lets say you ran into, I don't know, a black shulk, it could help you hide from it or give you a way to resist a power we know it has. Does that seem interesting ?&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;We can't sustain too many spells with our current Gnosis, so we need something interesting we can offer. Both of us have good knowledge of mysticism, and despite some quackery found here and there, Sleeper occult knowledge has more than a few pearls people forget about. Plus he mentioned contracts, and changeling myths are normally associated with the fae, so being able to keep safe by capitalizing on magic that has certain clauses is probably something he can use.&quot;</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 03-27-2023, 01:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-29T02:49:50-07:00","id":1506835,"title":"","content":"As Elpis and Jaye walk back out to the main room, the dull thump of heavy feet ascending stairs relays through the spell. Jaye looks around, slightly confused, but the sounds are directed enough that he is only hearing the faintest edges of what Elpis is.<br /> <br /> Gil glances furtively at the pair as they enter, relaxing when it's obvious his bar isn't being invaded by more angry Mages.<br /> <br /> &quot;I suppose, though our concerns are usually... er... <i>classes</i> of entities, rather than individuals. Being able to roll the knucklebones would certainly be useful. Can you... I dunno... preserve perishables, or increase the quality of foodstuffs? Jaye can spin straw into gold and the like, but we can't always get the best or freshest ingredients.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-29T17:57:41-07:00","id":1506900,"title":"","content":"Elpis walks back over and takes a seat next to Qaf.<br /> &quot;Hey, we're back. The restroom is open if you want to clean up. What did I miss?&quot;<br /> They very happily start to have some calamari.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-29T19:12:28-07:00","id":1506907,"title":"","content":"<i>&quot;Perfect timing, Elpis. Now I can use the bathroom as an excuse to be a more prepared in case Dantes gives the signal. If I am ready and he calls, I can ward all 4 of us in one fell swoop and start making my way there&quot;</i><br /> <br /> &quot;We were going over some of the things we bring to the table. <i>Divination </i>is a spell I know well, so predictions are no problem.&quot; Qaf turns back to Gil &quot;I would be happy to give an example after they finish, its normal to ward from scrying across time and space in important meetings such as that. Considering Cloudchaser is a very good Time mage, its pretty much guaranteed. My spells would hit those defenses, which would be considered bad form.<br /> <br /> Occult wards were also discussed, the types that can impose a Ban on a specific creature.<br /> <br /> We just started talking about spells for preserving the freshness of the food or improving its quality. I know just the spell for that, the <i>Veil of Moments</i>, it can keep food from spoiling and it could be cast on the area of a pantry, everything will be as fresh as the moment you store it. It has some useful side benefits as well, such as anyone inside the area not becoming hungrier or more tired. It stops bleeding, diseases don't get worse, it pauses the effects of poisons and generally gives a lot of breathing room to get help. Before continuing, I want to wash my hands first, where is the bathroom please ?&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;No way I stand a chance of KOing more experienced mages without Kinetic Blow, if it even comes to that, Dantes will probably have a quick bark of the objective. Worst case scenario, I throw out a Veil of Moments to prevent them from being in any risk of permanent damage, even if that comes with containing some Paradox. Lets just hope it doesn't escalate to all that. Not sure how Elpis would approach the situation. We will just have to prepare the best we can and adapt from there&quot;</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 03-29-2023, 10:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-29T20:34:39-07:00","id":1506921,"title":"","content":"&quot;<i>Oh, I see! The conversation is still on what we can do. Great! I hope I can discuss how Changelings can convert psychic energy into a more manifest state of being. I suppose I could help them gather energy. Though, I don't know how comfortable I am with manipulating people's emotions like that. I guess I'll need to study it more before I take a stance. I think they mentioned wanting people with poor intentions to not bother the place. How could I help there? Maybe I could make this place feel more secure and riskier to rob? I wonder if I can fenagle the resonance of this place to working towards that goal?&quot;</i><br /> <br /> &quot;Cool. Should I go over my study of Mind while you are gone? I think there is a lot of stuff I could do to help out with that. Or should I go with Forces for food preservation, lower electricity bills, and the like?&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">&quot;<i>Wait, I didn't think this through. If Qaf goes into the bathroom, he might discover my listening spell. I...don't know what would happen then. Should I cancel the s</i><i>pell?\u200b\u200b Am I even doing the right thing? Ok, OK, don't panic. If I show panic, he might know something is up. I just need to remain calm. He is my cabal mate, but I've only known him for a couple of hours. I shouldn't be putting him in this position. What should I do? What should I do? Just stay calm Elpis.&quot; </i></div></div> </div> </div><i>\u200b</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-30T13:55:40-07:00","id":1506988,"title":"","content":"&quot;Whichever one sounds best, sounds like you already have some ideas for Mind. I was thinking of throwing Prime in there too. Hallows and Nodes normally come in pairs, so depending on the Resonance, we could align the bar to harness it. Quickly growing spices, free power and making things slowly self repair are all possible benefits. Anyway, be right back&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;I have no idea how long I have, so need to get ready. Plus I want some calamari.&quot;</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 03-30-2023, 04:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-01T01:43:40-07:00","id":1507100,"title":"","content":"The voices Elpis hears through their spell are somewhat muffled, but clear enough to understand. <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Hiawatha: -ter, may I introduce Hierarch Santiago and the Council of Little Atlantis. <br /> <br /> Cynosure: Hierarch. <br /> <br /> Santiago: Lictor. Voter. If it has not already been offered, then allow me to formally declare your right of safe passage until you have exited our territory. Please, be seated, and let us hear what White Sands wants known. <br /> <br /> Cynosure?: Thanks for the hospitality, but I'll stand. I'll be brief, since the message is brief and we have several other Consilli to deliver it to as soon as possible. Hierarch Underhill has achieved Ascension, and been succeeded by Hierarch Demandred. <br /> <br /> Santiago: My congratulations. *Santiago's tone is dry, as if he disliked one or both of the White Sand Hierarchs*<br /> <br /> Cynosure?: The Hierarch's first order of buisness has been to excise a tumor festering within our Orders, the effect of which you may soon be encountering. All Moros mages who do not belong to the Order of the Iron Tower Legacy are banned and exiled from White Sand territory, as are any member of Matter-based Legacies. Any Moros who enters our territory after the 21st will be treated as a Servant of The Lie - Legacy-less Moros will be given the chance to initiate to the Iron Tower, but those who refuse or cannot initiate will be executed. Leniency will be given on a case-by-case basis for certain Legacies, such as the Elan or the Astral Adepts.<br /> <br /> *Silence stretches for a minute*<br /> <br /> Santiago: Well, I can certainly say I did not expect that. I had thought this would be related to the untimely demise of my Leigewoman. To be honest, I have been expecting to receive a demand for reparations fir quite a while now.<br /> <br /> Ferdiad?: The death of that holy avatar is not lain at your feet, Hierarch, though my brethren hold your Order <i>deeply</i> responsible. <br /> <br /> Santiago: *Somewhat sarcastic* Well, that is quite reassuring.<br /> <br /> Ferdiad?: However, the her martyrdom was the final straw, that opened the eyes of the Hierarch. The Bellerophon's actions showed that the Moros will destroy any escape from the Lie we can create. <br /> <br /> Dantes: And so Demandred decided to, what, take over a Consilium and declare war on an entire Watchtower? *<i>very</i> sarcastic*What next, will he proclaim for the Adamant Crown?<br /> <br /> *Another stretch of silence*<br /> <br /> Dantes: <i>He proclaimed for the Adamant Crown?!</i><br /> <br /> Nighthawk: Gonna need a refresher on what that is, chief.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Gil's eyes light up slightly at the mention of electric bills<br /> &quot;One of the Stars was always talking about some spell he could cast on the generators so they'd never run out of fuel! Or was it that they'd be able to run without fuel... He kept talking about &quot;Imbuing it&quot; or &quot;Enhancing them&quot;, or something, but never got around to it.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;The fridge could be colder.&quot; Jaye grunts thoughtfully, as he leads Qaf back to the staff restroom<br /> <br /> &quot;Ah zip it, you polar bear. How about something to make our patrons feel calm and happy, or gives them the munchies?&quot;<br /> <br /> ----<br /> In the staff bathroom, Qaf finds that sound is oddly muted. Which he might not have noticed normally if his Mage Sight didn't immediately start pinging.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-01T12:59:19-07:00","id":1507114,"title":"","content":"<i>&quot;Lets just hope that is Elpis and not a spell clipping through the wall, a quick look at the Nimbus should do the trick&quot;</i> Qaf instinctively activates his Prime and Forces sights, seeing Elpis's Nimbus in a corner of the room, his sight recognizing a Forces effect <i>&quot;So Elpis did make the most of the opportunity, good, but I was expecting a spell cast on them. What exactly is this ? The sound in this room is muffled, so a variation of Control Sound ? But its placed in the corner of the room, like an ear to the wall, so is this like a magical listening bug ? Probably...huh, I did not expect that, its a very elegant solution, I need to remember that one in the future. But for now, I need to get ready.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Qaf turns on the faucet<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;I can't use a mantra here, because if Jaye hears me &quot;speaking in tongues&quot;, he might assume things will invariably escalate. When I go back, I will be in a good position to ward all of us before going upstairs, which should make a difference in keeping everyone safe. Since I have a bathroom sink here, I can use that to my advantage&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Qaf spits on his hands, using that to increase the conductivity of the Aetherial storm. He starts cracking his knuckles, but at certain points of the gesture, he almost imperceptibly transitions to the Five Lakes and Four Seas martials arts salute. Its a very old mudra, symbolizing the Arrow warning his foe that he is about to use violence, while simultaneously demonstrating respect for their opponent. The familiar circuitry of his Imagos starts building on his limbs, ready to channel the energy of the storm, like in the day of his Awakening. But as it does, the circuitry flows into him like a river, towards his dantian, the circuit being compressed into it. The energy spins with the dantian and the Qi energized by Aetherial energy flows to his limbs, the nondistinct nature of the rote having completely hidden his Nimbus.<br /> <br /> Qaf starts washing his hands.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Okay, ready. If someone tries anything, I have a way to help knock them out. Hopefully Elpis will give enough of a heads up that I can ward everyone before Dantes gives the signal&quot;</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 04-01-2023, 04:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-01T16:01:21-07:00","id":1507128,"title":"","content":"<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> <i>&quot;I don't think there is anything I can do about Qaf. I'm just going to need to trust in him.&quot;</i></div></div> </div> </div>\u200b<br /> <br /> &quot;Ha, I'm not quite good enough to make a perpetual motion machine just yet...though if there truly is a Node here as well as a Hallow, we might be able to reduce your electricity usage down to near zero. Might take some extra elbow geese to align the electrical devices with the energy flow, but it would save you loads of money. No, I was more thinking about heating. I won't hazard a guess to your exact numbers, but I remember reading a graph breaking down most businesses' electrical expenses and Heating, AC, and Venting are one of the highest. Heat is exceptionally easy to manipulate, and I could regulate it so this room always stays at room temperature for example. Or keep it at like...I don't know, like -20* Celsius. or whatever temperature it is you want. If we do that for your food storage, stuff should stay fresh for a very long Time...but not as long as what Qaf can do with Time. As I understand, that Veil of Moment's spell can keep stuff fresh forever...or at least until the spell fades anyways. Some people have even tried to use it for immortality! but that doesn't work out too well.&quot;<br /> <br /> Elpis has more Calamari and takes a long drink afterward.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> <i>&quot;Oh, wow. I wonder if they left a Sarir- &quot;</i></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> They start to cough as they partially choke on their water.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> <i>&quot;Wha-What? They did what? Is this a War Declaration?</i>\u200b <i>Oh my God. What- Are they insane? Trying to remove a whole Path? What possible reason-the Iron Tower! What did Pandora say about them? They disdain the material world as a distraction to ascension, literally Mind over Matter. And it looks like a more Fanatical follower of that ideology made it to the position of Hierarch. What does that mean? What do they mean by feeling the effects of that? &quot;</i> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> &quot;Sorr-<span style=\"font-size:9px\">*Cough</span><span style=\"font-size:8px\">*</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Sorry.</span><span style=\"font-size:9px\">*Cough</span><span style=\"font-size:8px\">*</span><span style=\"font-size:9px\">*Cough</span><span style=\"font-size:8px\">*</span>\u200b<span style=\"font-size:9px\">*Cough</span><span style=\"font-size:8px\">*</span>\u200b\u200bI-I'm fine<span style=\"font-size:9px\">*Cough</span><span style=\"font-size:8px\">*</span>\u200bReally. &quot;<br /> <br /> They take a moment to breathe, before continuing.<br /> <br /> &quot;Anyways, if we stick to Forces and Prime, Qaf and I can work together to make any spell extremely potent, but if go with our separate fields of study, it's going to be a lot smaller, and less potent. Qaf studies Time, and I study the Mind. I can indeed manipulate emotions to an extent, I can draw people's attention, magnify certain emotions, or even project emotions onto them. I would need to be careful though...it's very easy to hurt others by mistake with Mind. And I don't have a lot of experience here. I usually just stick to clearing my memory, telepathic communications, and extreme multitasking. Occasionally, lucid dreaming. But if you want, I think I can safely manipulate the vibe of this place to make people relaxed in general. What I think might be better is enhancing the attention this place gets. I could leave a spell that makes it so people will remember their experience here, and if it's positive, which this calamari says that it will be, they would be inclined to come back when they are hungry. Moreover, I could make it so the place gets more attention from those who are hungry while passing by. It won't make the decision to come in for them, but they would have it in their minds as an option. One thing to note with mental spells is that the sufficiently strong-willed can shake off just about anything I can do. I could just make the spell stronger, but that means the weaker-willed will be affected that much more.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> &quot;<i>Wait...are they talking about...Pandora? Holy Avatar? She would have laughed at the notion. Was she connected to White Sands? She never talked about it with me. Is that really true?...so Bellerophon. Is that a Shadow Name of a Moros Guardian? I have a name now. I suppose it's no surprise that Santiago knew...Wait, they are using her death to justify...it's too much. too horrible. I can't...No. I will learn the Truth no matter what. I have to. That's the only way I can honor the person she was. I'm her legacy now, I can't let her down.</i><i>&quot;</i></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":26736,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","user":"TempleBuilder","date":". 04-01-2023, 07:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-01T17:15:28-07:00","id":1507132,"title":"","content":"Qaf walks back to his seat.<br /> <br /> &quot;I'm back, what did I miss ?&quot;<br /> <br /> Qaf cheerfully starts eating some calamari.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;This is really delicious, glad I got to eat some calamari before something happens. If I wasn't on standby, I would order an aperol spritz, that would pair well with this. Elpis looks really hyper, guess things aren't going well upstairs&quot;</i><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-01T17:51:59-07:00","id":1507138,"title":"","content":"<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> <b>Clean Sweep:</b> The Adamant Crown is an Arrow heresy, an assertation that only those who have shed blood in the name of Atlantis have to right to rule the Awoken nation. A conquering king. The Ladder, as you might imagine, is... not a fan.<br /> <br /> <b>Cloudchaser:</b> Nor are any of the Pentacle, really.<br /> <br /> <b>Watchtower:</b> The last time someone declared for the Crown, they took over five Consili in England by the sword. This... Iron Dominon hasn't made moves toward conquest yet, but even proclaiming it is going to put the backs up for anywhere that's heard the story.<br /> <br /> <b>Cynosure?:</b> I'll thank you to not use that name, Moros. We are still a Consilium, and it smacks too much of the Seers.<br /> <br /> <b>Watchtower:</b> Frankly, Cynosure, I don't give a damn.<br /> <br /> <b>Santiago and Dantes:</b> Sentinel. <br /> <br /> <b>Warchtower:</b> *Voice tight* Hierarch.<br /> <br /> <b>Cynosure:</b> The Voter and I were selected as messenges for this declaration to show the united intent of White Sands. Our Orders are so often at loggerheads, but we speak with one voice on this.<br /> <br /> <b>Nighthawk:</b> And you support a monarchy, Voter? A <i>dictatorship</i>? Disappointing. <br /> <br /> <b>Ferdiad:</b> Even a dictatorship can have an assembly of the people, Syndic. Who better to keep them grounded?<br /> <br /> <b>Nighthawk:</b> *Disgusted noise*<br /> <br /> <b>Cynosure:</b> The Hierarch has taken up the true crown, not the feeble copy worn by Apollonius. We do not demand your submission-<br /> <br /> <b>Cloudchaser:</b> Which we wouldn't offer anyway!<br /> <br /> <b>Cynosure:</b> -but know that we intend to unite the Pentacle fully against the Lie. I hope you will be on the right side of history.<br /> <br /> <b>Santiago:</b> History is written by the survivors, Lictor. I think I have heard enough. Hiawatha, Sunshine. Kindly escort these messengers downstairs, and see them safely to their next destination. We, at least, have not abandoned all propriety. Watchtower, you will remain.<br /> <br /> <b>Hiawatha, Sunshine, Watchtower:</b> Yes, Hierarch.<br /> <br /> <b>Santiago:</b> Any Moros fleeing your territory may find sanctuary here. You <i>will</i> announce that message for them, Lictor. *Forcefully, as if forestalling the other mage* That will be all Lictor. I am not in the habit of shooting messengers, but expounding further will not help your position.<br /> <br /> <b>Dantes:</b> And if he doesn't, I will.<br /> <br /> *A door opens. Footsteps receed in the spell's hearing, but grow louder in Elpis' mundane ears*</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Gil looks thoughtful, drumming his fingers on the countertop. &quot;Not a lot, mostly some useful options.&quot;<br /> <br /> He exhales slowly. &quot;From what I gathered, we're not the only place you're looking at. How likely do you think you'll be to choose us over a different property? As fun as spitballing is, I'd rather not be blueballed. We're happy to trade tass-beer, cash, or Hedge-fare to you in exchange for spellwork, obviously. But I'd imagine complicated stuff will either require a hefty payout from us, or you being personally invested in the property.&quot;<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-01T18:15:57-07:00","id":1507139,"title":"","content":"<i>&quot;Oh dang it- he knows-oh no&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Elpis immediately disperses both spells. They turn to Qaf, with a mild look of panic.<br /> <br /> &quot;Uh, hold on a second Gil. Uh, Qaf? Could you maybe drop that spell, or Veil it? Please? The meeting up there is ending and tensions really don't need PMS giving them the wrong idea. Also maybe we should get out of their way.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-01T18:21:26-07:00","id":1507141,"title":"","content":"&quot;PMS? Lady troubles?&quot; Gil mutters to Jaye, both looking very confused.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-01T18:28:39-07:00","id":1507142,"title":"","content":"&quot;No! It's an acronym-never mind. Please. Please. Don't do anything that could be misunderstood as a threat.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-01T18:58:51-07:00","id":1507151,"title":"","content":"<i>&quot;Did you just give away that you were spying on them ? Then also revealed that I had a spell active ? WHY !? This won't end well, okay, how do I salvage this ? Step one, point out to Elpis not to give any more information away. Step two, maintain readiness in case the last stretch sours.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> &quot;Don't worry, I intend to drop the spell as soon as I hear movement on the steps. So even if your hunch is right, I have no intention of provoking them&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-01T18:59:55-07:00","id":1507152,"title":"","content":"The drum of feet on the stairs quickly announces the arrival of four people - Sunshine, followed by the messengers with Hiawatha bringing up the rear. The two locals look grim, flanking the visitors like guards. The visitors simply wear long-suffering expressions. <br /> Upon spotting them, Ferdiad immediately makes a beeline for Elpis, brushing past Sunshine. She in turn snaps a bubble of her gum as she glares at him, and everyone's Mage Sight registers an instant of a spell being cast.<br /> <br /> Hiawatha's expression darkens, and he steps forward to restrain Feridad. Sunshine, however, stops the Herald with a raised hand.<br /> <br /> Ferdiad bows to Elpis, his fist planted over his heart. &quot;You are Elpis, student of my sister Pandora? She spoke highly of you, niece.<br /> <br /> &quot;It does not make up for our failure to protect her, but should you wish to initiate into our Legacy I will be happy to sponsor you.&quot;<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-01T19:24:00-07:00","id":1507156,"title":"","content":"Qaf had dropped the spell by the time he heard the footsteps and is keeping a watch on the situation.<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;This guy is as subtle as a stampede of rhinos, no sign of hostile action yet, lets see where this leads. Watch for any signs of escalation, see if the others signal for me to retrain him&quot;</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-01T19:55:15-07:00","id":1507157,"title":"","content":"Elpis bows back, respectful but decidedly cautious.<br /> <br /> &quot;I am Elpis, indeed. You must be of the Elan. I am afraid I had not heard of you before today. Pandora rarely spoke of specific people, I believe she wanted to truly introduce me when I was fully Initiated. But my Soul had not been fully refined. It still isn't ready. But I fully intend to face the Trials and Follow her Legacy.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-01T20:11:37-07:00","id":1507158,"title":"","content":"Cynosure gives an impatient cough, which earns him a glare from Ferdiad. The Voter grimaces, and hands Elpis a stiff, gilded buisness card. &quot;I'm afraid my duties call, but please contact me whenever you wish. I will be happy to help you prepare.&quot;<br /> <br /> Both Sunshine and Hiawatha look disapproving, but they do not delay. Sunshine strides over to the doorway to the kitchen, hefting her sledgehammer before swinging it at the open air. Mage Sight pings as the empty space of the doorway seems to shatter, the shards falling away to reveal a psychedelic landscape of twisting conifers growing from shifting dunes. The land seems to Warp back on itself, with the pathforward abruptly becoming the &quot;sky&quot; above<br /> <br /> &quot;Alright, where's your next stop?&quot; Sunshine asks, already casting another spell.<br /> <br /> Cynosure grimaced in distaste, studying the sandy path. &quot;Seattle. Can't we just Teleport, Herald?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;No.&quot; Hiawatha growls, hustling the two through the Iris with the minimum decorum necessary to not be insulting.<br /> <br /> Sunshine hangs back for a moment &quot;Jaye, babe, I'll try to be back in an hour. Save me something for dinner?&quot; The scarred man nods, blushing slightly as she kisses his cheek.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-01T20:33:09-07:00","id":1507159,"title":"","content":"Elpis sighs, puts the card in their bag and shakes their head.<br /> <br /> \u201cPMS also stands for Peripheral Mage Sight. We can feel when Magic happens around us, but not exactly what. With tension so high, I didn\u2019t want anyone to get the wrong idea. Anyways, back to bargaining: to properly answer your question, I\u2019m going to need to confer with Qaf.\u201d","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-01T20:37:07-07:00","id":1507160,"title":"","content":"&quot;Please, take a booth&quot; As you walk away, you hear the two begin to bicker.<br /> <br /> &quot;See, Jaye, this is the kind of stuff you should be asking Sunshine about!&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;'I'm not going to grill someone I just started dating, Ethan!&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;This is why we can't have nice things!&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-02T08:03:01-07:00","id":1507184,"title":"","content":"<i>&quot;The fact Cloudchaser and Dantes have not come down yet means both the Hierophant and the Adamant Sage found issue with whatever was discussed, this does not bode well. We aren't out of the woods yet, we need to be more careful when they come down</i>\u200b, <i>so they won't know we were listening in.</i><i>&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Qaf waits for Elpis to sit down, he checks to make sure the others haven't started to come back down before beginning:<br /> <br /> &quot;The meeting up there is ending and tensions are high, we really don't need PMS giving them the wrong idea. Also maybe we should get out of their way. There was no guesswork in your statements, just perfect certainty about the flow and tempo of the negotiations. A reasonable follow-up question would be: how did you know ? You admitted to your use of the listening bug spell in the same statement that you exposed my own preparations.<br /> <br /> I suggested the bathroom to open an opportunity for you to act, without triggering anyone's Peripheral Sight. It also provided plausible deniability on why you weren't called out on that spell.<br /> <br /> Which means that if I capitalized on the same opportunity, but came back with an active effect, then the situation changed in a way that lowered the priority for discretion. You were clearly reacting to the tension of it all, so the chances of things escalating were still high.<br /> <br /> I was under orders to be ready in case that happened. With a <i>Kinetic Blow</i>\u200b spell in place, if their negotiations soured, I could ward all 4 of us before rushing upstairs, all without risking Paradox. The chances of anyone receiving lasting damage went down and my ability to aid in incapacitating hostiles went up, at least in theory.<br /> <br /> This was&quot; his gaze drifts towards the stairs for a moment &quot;is a tense situation, and being deliberate is our best bet of navigating it&quot;\u200b<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Covering everything that they discussed should probably be done afterwards&quot;</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 04-02-2023, 02:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-02T13:17:06-07:00","id":1507203,"title":"","content":"&quot;<i>What? He gave me the opportunity on purpose... I'm an idiot.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> &quot;I'm sorry, I misjudged you and your intentions. I didn't realize you purposefully suggested the bathroom, and I left a spell to listen in. I didn't remember if that spell activates PMS or not, and I thought you were coming out with Peirce Deception because apparently, I'm now a spy or something. I'm sorry. I just...things were bad, ok? When the Adamant Sage says something to the effect of &quot;leave or I will kill you&quot;, anyone would be jumpy! And you were there, appearing to be waiting for them, an Arrow with a spell active and I just...I didn't want anyone to die! All because I listened in to a conversation.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;We...don't have time for this. When everyone is gone I will fill you in, and show you my memories of it if I have to. But not right now. They could be back down any second now, and Gil and Jaye need to hear a decision. Do you have a favored option to claim?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":26736,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","user":"TempleBuilder","date":". 04-02-2023, 04:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-02T14:05:48-07:00","id":1507210,"title":"","content":"&quot;I prefer the Cottage, a bar means the occasional Sleeper being very close to whatever we are looking into. But I also favor negotiating with Gil and Jaye for some tass, we give them a hand through some helpful spells and gain access to some practical tass in return. Sounds like a mutually beneficial deal&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-02T14:11:53-07:00","id":1507216,"title":"","content":"\u201cI agree. Let\u2019s give them our answer.\u201d","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-02T15:18:01-07:00","id":1507226,"title":"","content":"&quot;Alright. Let's go&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Dantes said &quot;leave or I will kill you&quot; !? In in the presence of a Lictor ? So not even a Duel Arcane would not be enough to settle it ? What exactly happened up there ? Okay, we are on the final stretch, negotiate for some tass and then avoid throwing more fuel to the fire when they come down&quot;</i><br /> <br /> After leaving the booth and returning to Gil<br /> <br /> &quot;We would like to support your business. But seeing any obvious use of our magic is traumatizing to most non-supernatural people, no matter how harmless or helpful the spell is. If business goes up and we work from here, chances are it will eventually happen. So while we will go with the other Hallow, we are open to negotiations.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-02T15:31:58-07:00","id":1507229,"title":"","content":"Gil looks somewhat disappointed, but nods in understanding. &quot;Guess we don't want our patrons having a mental breakdown. Well, we're here whenever you want to trade for Tass. Or for Hedge-fare or contacts with the Goblin Market. I'd be interested in you setting up that time-stasis thing in the store room in the near future - would three bottles of Tass be fair payment?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-02T15:43:53-07:00","id":1507230,"title":"","content":"\u201cUh, hey. So the the place we are probably going to end up with, well it\u2019s going to be a nice Sanctum and very few people will disturb us, but it\u2019s kinda a wreak. It\u2019s going to be a lot of effort to make it\u2026you know, livable. Is there any way you guys could help out? We would be super grateful for anything at all. Like, we could definitely set you up with a bunch of those spells!\u201d","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-02T16:02:37-07:00","id":1507231,"title":"","content":"&quot;Hmm... I think we could find you a work crew to get it done quick...&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Cleon and his lot might be willing to work Ironside.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;The Wizened Gremlin with the Hobs? Yeah, that might work, as long as you two don't mind your house becoming very... eh... stony? Cleon mostly works Hedgeside raising megaliths, so he'll likely rebuild most of the structure out of stone quarried in the Hedge.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I think that new pledge in Barter said she was an electrician.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Ooh, yeah, she'd probably appreciate the work... So yeah, we can get you in contact with contractors from the more interesting side of life. You'll need to work out the costs with them, but we'll be happy to help negotiations for a reasonable fee. Say, the stasis on our storeroom, or three Divinations we can call on at any time?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":27258,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","user":"Cauthon","date":". 04-02-2023, 07:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-02T16:07:23-07:00","id":1507232,"title":"","content":"\u201cWorks for me. Qaf?\u201d","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-02T16:15:10-07:00","id":1507233,"title":"","content":"&quot;Currently I can make the stasis last a week, the divinations will give you the most likely future at that time. Either option would be fine with me. Stone can make for a pretty rustic look, so I think that might work out well. What do you think ?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-02T16:34:45-07:00","id":1507237,"title":"","content":"&quot;Eh... a week probably isn't enough to make a proper difference. Let's go with the divinations. Both Jaye and I need to be present to use one, and we need to agree with each other on what we want divined. In exchange, we'll locate contractors for you and help negotiate fair prices for their work. Deal?&quot; Ethan holds out a hand to Qaf, and a faint tingle starts at the base of the Mage's neck.<br /> <br /> Jaye, meanwhile, has pulled out his phone. He holds it out to Elpis, displaying a QR code. &quot;Here, my contact information. No buisness cards here, y'understand.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.