hos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-02T17:16:18-07:00","id":1507242,"title":"","content":"As Qaf and Gil's hands clasp, the sound of their palms meeting seems to echo louder than it should, and the faint tolling of a bell can be heard. Gil nods in satisfaction.<br /> <br /> &quot;Well, we'll start asking around. Should have something for you by the end of the week. Want to order anything while you wait for the scary meteorologist?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-02T17:32:11-07:00","id":1507243,"title":"","content":"\u201cI think we still have some calamari left, thanks. I\u2019ve read a bit about Changelings, one the things mentioned how they could magically hold people to their word. I think I felt something just now, was that, uh what was the word, a pledge?\u201d","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-02T17:35:50-07:00","id":1507244,"title":"","content":"&quot;Just a Sealing. If either party goes back on their word, they suffer a minor inconvenience. We don't do Oaths or Pledges unless it's a big deal - those shape the soul in ways that can't be reversed.&quot;<br /> <br /> Gill looks thoughtful<br /> <br /> &quot;I actually don't know if we can do Oaths or Pledges with non-Changelings...&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-02T17:50:44-07:00","id":1507247,"title":"","content":"&quot;Soul-Shaping? I wonder if it's anything like our Legacies...I'd have to ask Moros. It's probably for the best that it doesn't work on non-Changelings, though. Soul-Shaping is quite serious, and if it is similar, a lot could go wrong. I'm sure someone has figured out how to do it anyways though.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-02T18:23:09-07:00","id":1507250,"title":"","content":"&quot;Fate magic would probably be an element, since it covers oaths, blessings, curses and so on. Probably having a connection to emotional energy would help too, like Mind or Spirit. Those are all elements of the soul, so maybe a spell could be used to allow one system to work with the other. Who knows if that would result in the soul shaping needed for a Legacy&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-02T19:46:49-07:00","id":1507253,"title":"","content":"Around ten minutes later, footsteps on the stairs announce the descent of the Council. <br /> <br /> Dantes nods curtly to the room, flashing the handsign for &quot;<i>threat has passed/stand down</i>&quot; to Qaf. He stalks out into the growing dusk without a word.<br /> <br /> Nighthawk settles into a booth, once again unleashing a torrent into her phone. While not loud, she's clearly agitated and speaking in a foreign language.<br /> <br /> Clean Sweep leans against the far end of the bar, morosly ordering a fruity drink from Gil.<br /> <br /> Santiago studies Qaf and Elpis with some concern, until Cloudchaser pulls his head close and whispers something to him. The Hierarch grimaces, but nods and heads for the door.<br /> <br /> Cloudchaser approaches the pair, hands stuffed into her coat pockets. <br /> <br /> &quot;I trust our... guests... didn't give you any trouble? We'll be sending around a formal proclamation about what they wanted in the next day or two.&quot;<br /> <br /> She shoots an amused glance at Jaye, who is inching uncomfortably towards the kitchen.<br /> <br /> &quot;In the meantime, how was your property negotiations?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-02T21:03:42-07:00","id":1507258,"title":"","content":"&quot;I believe we have our choice. We have decided upon Hyleen Cottage, mostly because it would make the better Sanctum. We also negotiated with Gil and Jaye, we will be casting some Divinations at some point in exchange for them to help us fix up the Cottage. Well, finding us help to fix up the Cottage anyways. I got Jaye's phone number so I can call them so we officially can do stuff with the property...Which.. uh brings me to this&quot;<br /> <br /> Elpis pulls out the gilded card.<br /> <br /> &quot;Voter...Ferdiad, I think his name was, wanted to see if I was interested in being introduced to the Elan Legacy. He said he knew Pandora...but he apparently was on a schedule and had to leave soon after. He gave me this.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-08T03:24:43-07:00","id":1507756,"title":"","content":"Cloudchaser stares down at the card in Elpis' hand for a long moment, before exhaling slowly.<br /> <br /> &quot;Politics. I'm not cut out for politics. The sooner Mother Thunder gets back from vacation the better. She got elected to the damn Councilor job for a <i>reason</i>.&quot;<br /> <br /> She screws her eyes shut, rubbing at the bridge of her nose.<br /> <br /> &quot;OK. The Voter is... not as bad as the Lictor, but I don't recommend trusting either of them. Please try to avoid getting entangled with him. Honestly, bartering with whichever Aeon governs the Elan's Arcana -Prime?- would be safer. At least that bargain would be over and done with quickly, and a Mystagog could accompany you for safety.<br /> <br /> &quot;I'm glad you two have settled on a Hallow so quickly. Hyleen's been untended for too long, even with such a large Consilium we have too many Hallows to properly care for them all. I'll have the paperwork turning ownership over to you two finalized this week, and send them via a Herald. Do you have any aliases or alternate identities you want on the paperwork?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-08T14:16:57-07:00","id":1507783,"title":"","content":"&quot;<i>Oh, I wonder if that was really the right choice? I was open and honest...but I've added to her burdens. I'm sorry.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Elpis quickly puts away the card back into their bag.<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>Going to Lilith? Bargaining with an Aeon never leaves the world unchanged...The only bargain I've read about with Lilith I think required the creation of a Dominion in her Name. Would she ask a similar price of me? Where would I even start?... Maybe it would be safer overall to talk to Pandora's Echo. I'd need to ask the Mysterium for access to her soul stone, and I'd need someone or something to cast Goetic Evocation. Maybe I could ask for a Stored Spell? I don't really think they would let me have access to either. Maybe if I progressed deeper into the Mysterium...I haven't refined my soul enough, this can wait.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> &quot;No, I'm not a Guardian. I'm only me. Qaf?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-08T15:43:34-07:00","id":1507791,"title":"","content":"<i>&quot;Asking Ferdiad for tutelage is a loaded option, it brings a lot of political baggage with it. Visiting an Aeon for that seems overkill, and will probably require a price. Finding a Legacy realm would need an efficient way of reaching the Astral, which we don't have, and be lucky enough to pick the trail of a Grimoire. Another option would be to hope Pandora left a ghost.... the ghost of a Rapt ? NO, just no. Let's keep it short and simple, use Postcognition to study the soul stone from a stable time, Elpis was greenlit by a Legacy member and they are Pandora's heir apparent, so it should be fine, I will bring this up later&quot;</i><br /> <br /> &quot;None on my side either&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Interesting that Elpis thinks its only Guardians that do covert operations, the Council of Dragons need spies to gather good information and setup their strategies, the other Order probably have their version too.&quot;</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 04-08-2023, 07:38 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-08T17:47:16-07:00","id":1507805,"title":"","content":"&quot;Oh, my sweet summer child. Maybe we <i>are</i> getting as lax as Dantes fears. In any event, I'll have Liberty deliver the papers. They'll probably be your designated Herald anyway, being a Mystagog. Citadel's a good kid, but has his plate full running down the other Guardians whenever we send out an announcement.<br /> <br /> &quot;You're free to start occupying the property as of this moment, though I'd recommend waiting on full-scale renovations until everything is nice and legal.<br /> <br /> &quot;Now, unless you have anything you'd like to discuss with me... do I need to take you back to the Lighthouse for vehicles?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-08T18:07:22-07:00","id":1507811,"title":"","content":"&quot;I walked there, since the weather was pretty nice, so I'm good&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-08T18:23:14-07:00","id":1507813,"title":"","content":"<i>\u201cWait\u2026what? What did I miss? Why would I need another Name? I don\u2019t know how Guardians can tolerate being pulled in separate directions by having different Shadow Names. Maybe that\u2019s not what she was referring to?\u201d</i><br /> <br /> \u201cI think it\u2019s going to take some time for preparations for renovations to be ready anyways.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI think I\u2019m good walking from here too\u2026\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201d<i>I still need to finish that conversation with Qaf. Don\u2019t know how to excuse us for a more private meeting-\u201c</i><br /> <br /> \u201dWait Qaf, I don\u2019t believe we\u2019ve swapped our numbers yet. Is there a messenger app you prefer?\u201d","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":26736,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","user":"TempleBuilder","date":". 04-08-2023, 10:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-08T18:57:37-07:00","id":1507815,"title":"","content":"&quot;I prefer Signal, its well encrypted, not associated with major data collection companies and has just about everything you need. I will send a friend request&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;It also allows messages to disappear on a timer, which is good if we need to work in very low key situations&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Qaf sends the invite, its a different name from his Shadow Name, called WaystoneChronicler, probably a reference to the <i>Kingkiller Chronicles</i>.<br /> <br /> &quot;Having an alternate identity is not only helpful for Guardians. Its a good way to help separate your Shadow Name from your sympathetic name. Some Talons working on the Council of Dragons, for example, might use them when investigating Seer activity. Its a useful skill, but I haven't invested the time and effort to learn to do it well&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 04-08-2023, 10:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-08T19:56:13-07:00","id":1507819,"title":"","content":"Cloudchaser nods, collaring Watchtower as the Moros heads for the door.<br /> <br /> &quot;You two have a safe night then. Contact me if you need anything. Watchtower? A word.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-08T19:56:32-07:00","id":1507820,"title":"","content":"<i>\u201cOh. I hadn\u2019t thought of that. Well, I hope I won\u2019t need one any time soon.\u201d</i><br /> <br /> \u201cOh, ok let me get that set up.\u201d<br /> <br /> They mess about for a bit, eventually generating an account called StarbitCollector which is almost certainly a reference to the Mario Galaxy lime of games.<br /> <br /> They quickly send a message. \u201cTest/Hi\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cHave a good night.\u201d","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":26736,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","user":"TempleBuilder","date":". 04-09-2023, 01:38 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-08T20:08:31-07:00","id":1507822,"title":"","content":"&quot;Have a good evening&quot;<br /> <br /> Qaf writes back &quot;Hi there. Perfect, we are good to go&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Everything is setup, is that a Mario Galaxy reference ? How very nostalgic&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 04-09-2023, 02:05 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-08T22:40:27-07:00","id":1507835,"title":"","content":"Elpis waits until Cloudchaser moves away and quickly sends a second text, with a short time limit.<br /> <br /> \u201dWe need to talk. Do you know a safe spot?\u201d\u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-08T23:35:36-07:00","id":1507838,"title":"","content":"<i>&quot;Upstairs would be suspicious, hanging around here risks someone coming back and overhearing us. The easiest place to hide is in plain sight, heading to a coffee shop or the like after a bar would be weird, so stretching our legs after sitting around for a while would look the most natural&quot;</i><br /> <br /> &quot;Why don't we walk around the boardwalk ? There are parts that are less busy at this time and people will just think its a casual chat.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-08T23:45:42-07:00","id":1507839,"title":"","content":"\u201cOk, I think that will be fine.\u201d","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-09T04:44:58-07:00","id":1507858,"title":"","content":"Gil and Jaye make polite sounds as Elpis and Qaf leave, promising to be in contact as soon as they have some candidates for the restoration. <br /> <br /> ---<br /> <br /> Just past the Draught's parking lot, the Boardwalk stretches off along the coast. In the distance, the Hargrave Hotel and Spa looms on it's hilltop, a brooding hulk that forbids approaching the private cove it controls. In the opposite direction, the docks and marina fill the air with the steady clatter of rocking boats. The winter sun has already set, but small clusters of people still wander here and there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-09T10:30:53-07:00","id":1507876,"title":"","content":"As they start walking, Qaf reaches into the pockets of his coat for some dark leather gloves, to keep his hands warm as the temperature drops. When he thinks they are outside of earshot, but look casual enough, he starts:<br /> <br /> &quot;Right, it was good that we left, you could cut the tension in that meeting with a knife. A walk in the open air has always helped me work through problems. So you said there was a threat, something along the lines of &quot;<i>leave now or I will kill you</i>&quot; ? Since the Duel Arcane wasn't in the cards, are they starting the process to declare Nemesis ? What caused things to escalate so quickly ?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 04-09-2023, 01:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-09T12:24:58-07:00","id":1507887,"title":"","content":"Elpis turns their face to the slight breeze, using the chill to wake themselves up a little. They put their hand in their pockets, to better stop themselves from crossing their arms.<br /> <br /> \u201dWhite Sands has a new Hierarch, who promptly exiled all Moros from the Consilium who don\u2019t belong one of a few approved legacies. They stated that any Moros traveling to them would be captured and forced to join an approved Legacy on pain of execution. If they had already joined a different legacy\u2026White Sands has also declared it\u2019s that it\u2019s reaching for the Adamant Crown. Since you\u2019re an Arrow, I guess you know what that means. Everyone was upset and angry, and a lot of heated words thrown around. I\u2019m not good at politics, I don\u2019t know if we are technically officially at war with White Sands, but if we aren\u2019t, we soon will be. We will be told most of this tomorrow, if I remember right.\u201d<br /> <br /> Elpis stops walking for a moment, and looks at Qaf as if trying to fingers something out.<br /> <br /> \u201dDo you not care about why I was listening in? About why I might have been spying on a Consilium meeting? You even helped me, without even asking about what I was doing?\u201d","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":26736,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","user":"TempleBuilder","date":". 04-09-2023, 03:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-09T13:07:25-07:00","id":1507892,"title":"","content":"<i>&quot;That cult that claims Consilia should be ruled by warriors ? Normally they draw in Arrows from the Council of Dragons, which means they will strategically fortify before even starting a fight, I doubt they would make such a bold statement if they hadn't completed most of their preparations&quot;</i><br /> <br /> &quot;The Guardian who notified you about Pandora showed up. A Voter was with him, and was so focused on you that he lost all notions of his surroundings during an important meeting, showing he had an emotional steak in the situation. A member of the same Legacy was there and Lictor was called to mediate an impromptu meeting with the Councilors and Hierarch. All of that had a visible effect on you, since you probably guessed it was a follow up on the investigation. Because you looked pretty down on not being able to join, I gave you an opportunity to figure a way to listen in. I had guessed the situation had become a delicate matter affecting both Consilia, seem that was not the only order of business. Did they discuss the topic at all ?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-09T14:52:05-07:00","id":1507901,"title":"","content":"\u201cI\u2026you didn\u2019t know\u2026I\u2019m sorry. I was going to tell you, even before the meeting, but there was never a good moment. If we are truly cabalmates, you really should know. I\u2019m\u2026investigating the Truth behind Pandora\u2019s death. Watchtower informed me of her death, true, and she didn\u2019t lie to me, I\u2019ve checked. But Pandora wasn\u2019t near Rapture, wasn\u2019t even close. I\u2019ve examined her Nimbus so many times, she was <b>nothing</b> like the preserved Nimbuses of those who turned away from the Grace of Sophia. After Watchtower had left, I realized there were details missing, little things left out. Maybe it was an accident \u2026Maybe they don\u2019t know the truth\u2026Maybe, it was to protect the Guardians who \u2026killed her\u2026Maybe, Pandora was pursuing something dangerous and they thought I would chase after her if I knew. It doesn\u2019t really matter why. If I was right and the Guardians were hiding something, I couldn\u2019t just ask Watchtower. I\u2019d never get a straight answer, and I would letting them know I was investigating. And everyone I could turn to is linked to them.\u201d<br /> <br /> They pause, taking a moment breathe.<br /> <br /> \u201dShe left, not long before she became\u2026enraptured. I..don\u2019t know where she went, or what she was doing. I have no idea how to follow her trail. So I went a different path. I talked to anyone who might seem like they know something about the mechanics of Rapture, I\u2019ve read every book on the matter I could access from t\u200bhe Athenaeum. Nothing I learned helped me any, no clues emerged to help me find some closure. And then I get a email one day asking me to meet with Chouldchaser. And that there would be an Arrow named Qaf in attendance. And you can guess the rest. When I saw Watchtower, and a Lictor, I knew they would discuss Pandora. It was the first real lead I\u2019d had in so long. And they did! In a roundabout way. I think Pandora might been connected to White Sands\u2026they are using her death to justify what they are doing to the Moros. They said that a Moros killed her, and named Bellerophon as the killer. I don\u2019t know who that is. \u201d<br /> <br /> Elpis looks at Qaf. They look very tired.<br /> <br /> \u201cPlease, will you help me? I need to know the Truth, I need to know why she became Enraptured, why she had to die. And now there might be a war depending on the Truth. You clearly are very observant, you would see things I miss, things that might lead to the Truth. You can see back in Time, see where she went, what she was doing. The Bellerophon lead might be a dead end, if they are a Guardian, I might never find them. But Postcognition\u2026that would show the Truth better than anything of my means. Please.\u201d","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-09T18:30:53-07:00","id":1507910,"title":"","content":"&quot;You can count on it, I was already planning on helping you. It was clear on our conversation in the Lighthouse that you were still investigating. If something like that happened to Zephyr, I would be looking for answers too. Its why I offered to use <i>Postcognition </i>if you wanted, hopefully in a way that didn't give a hint to Santiago.&quot;<br /> <br /> Qaf ponders for a sec<br /> <br /> &quot;There is a lot to unpack, let's do it piecemeal, maybe we can figure out the next steps from there. I don't think the Guardians were trying to protect one of their own, its not consistent with their philosophy. Arrows have to work with them from time to time, sometimes in uncovering a threat or protecting a Censorea, so I was told a basic explanation on how they work, maybe going over that would be helpful.<br /> <br /> The Guardian act as a Wisdom sanity check for their cabal, trying to nudge them away from Hubris. They are also supposed to find threats to their cabal and the Consilium by spying, but they never spy on their own cabal, otherwise they wouldn't be accepted in the Pentacle. If other Guardians think you are suspicious, they can and will spy on you. Lastly, if a Wise solution to a problem can't be found, its their duty to sacrifice their own Wisdom to preserve that of everyone else. The ideal Guardian is someone who signed up for a thankless job, one that demands sacrifices, but is necessary because of how messy life can be. Well, at least that is how it was explained to me.<br /> <br /> So based on that, they would not want to pull blame away from them. Normally if they don't tell you something, they either think its because people will do something dangerous or it would get in the way of their duties. You mentioned Pandora became Rapt overnight, with no gradual changes ? So let's use Occam's razor, if her soul suddenly became very unstable, its because it was made unstable. She could have been the victim of some Left-Handed magic and they still haven't found the culprit.<br /> <br /> The soul stone has a part of her soul, which they can use to get a better idea of what happened to her. If anyone asks, they were just seizing an unstable magical item for the Censorea. If you ask for the soul stone, they can say studying Rapture via an item you had trouble containing is dangerous. They can veto it without anyone batting an eye, especially the culprit.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 04-09-2023, 09:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-09T20:08:00-07:00","id":1507914,"title":"","content":"Elpis nods, relief etched clear on their face.<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>I was that clear, even back at the Lighthouse? I guess then that everyone knows. So, I guess it's likely they have someone listening in on us even now. Maybe it's Watchtower? Do Emissaries take on that function?...I haven't really been fair to her, have I?&quot;</i><br /> <br /> &quot;That's...a good hypothesis. And one I hadn't considered&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>Can someone inflict rapture on someone else? The implications of that are horrifying. I haven't read of anything that can strip Wisdom from someone, only some tales about pursuing something too far. Maybe it could be something from the Lower Depths.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Elpis shivers a bit, then sighs.<br /> <br /> &quot;Unfortunately, we can only speculate right now. Uh, I almost certainly would be denied access if I requested it for Pandora's soul stone now. But the Mysterium will allow the worthy to learn. If I grow and prove myself, I would be allowed access. I'm sure of it. I wasn't concerned about the soul stone. It...fit everything that I've read about rapt soul stones, even the generation of Tulpas. I had seen enough of it for a lifetime. Do you think we'll need to need it?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;<i>I hope I don't ever have to see it again. But I'm not sure if my other options are better. Lilith, or Ferdiad. Both would have costs I'm not sure I'm willing to pay. At least with the Echo the danger is limited to me.</i> <i>Wait...</i><i>Voter Ferdiad said something odd, didn't he? Maybe I should show Qaf and see what he can see.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> &quot;Uh, actually. Do you mind if I show you my memory of things went down with the Meeting? It's possible that you would notice something I would miss.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-10T09:46:47-07:00","id":1507943,"title":"","content":"&quot;I don't think we will need the soul stone right now. But seeing the memory sounds like an excellent idea&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-10T15:58:20-07:00","id":1507971,"title":"","content":"Elpis nods.<br /> <br /> &quot;Ok, first I'm going to perfect my memory so you get exactly what I heard without any bias from me. And then I'm going to link to your mind and project the memories from the start, ok?&quot;<br /> <br /> Elpis takes out the Phial, feeling the field of energy connecting them and their dedicated tool, and holds it outs it out into the street light, illuminating the contents within.<br /> <br /> &quot;Ok, this going to be a bit cold&quot;<br /> <br /> They take out the fulgurite from their bag and focus on it as a bridge between their and Qaf's auras. They pour a bit of the illuminated water onto the rough stone, and gently reach up to trace a bit of water Qaf's forehead. They feel the successful conduction, and smile<br /> <br /> &quot;All done. Might want to wipe that off before you get frostbite. Ok, starting now.&quot;<br /> <br /> And then they project their memory of the overheard conversation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-10T19:20:00-07:00","id":1507988,"title":"","content":"As Qaf wipes the water from his forehead, he starts feeling the flow of memories. All so very clear, but they feel like they traveled a long distance to get there, like an echo he didn't even know he was listening for. He starts parsing through it slowly.<br /> <br /> &quot;I'm sorry, their Hierarch did what ? Full Ascension, holy grail of Awakened culture, A God Am I: The Spell, the inscrutable secret no one witnessed before and they say it so casually ? Heck, I still remember how the Silver Ladder recruiter went on and on about Merlin when they made their pitch. Wait a sec, how do they even know the difference between becoming an archmage or Ascending, when we don't know what either looks like ? How come he wasn't removed from office the second he started pursuing the Imperial Mysteries ? I don't buy it, that is an outright lie, but I am not sure what they are trying to hide.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 04-12-2023, 04:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-10T21:42:50-07:00","id":1507999,"title":"","content":"Elpis waits until they are sure Qaf doesn't need them to repeat a section before answering.<br /> <br /> &quot;Pandora once told me that the truly Ascended leave behind potent artifacts, Sariras. It's...the crystallized resonance of the moment of ascension. I don't know if it's every time, but if the Hierarch did Ascend and left one behind, White Sands could have a very potent tool to wage war with. Maybe that's why they are so confident...but if that's really true, wouldn't they be bragging about it as well? I mean, it's physical proof, undeniable, something to rally around. A full Sarira is practically unheard of, I think many mages would flock to their cause just to study it. Maybe you are right, and they are hiding something.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":26736,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","user":"TempleBuilder","date":". 04-11-2023, 11:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-12T09:35:36-07:00","id":1508156,"title":"","content":"&quot;They said it was Hierarch Demandred, I am not familiar with that name, maybe learning about him might give us a view on the bigger picture. The news were not publicly announced yet, so that could be helpful. Letting people know about a secret meeting would be bad form as well. So we could talk to a th\u00e9arch, tell them a mentor of a Legacy you are interested in joining is over there, but we aren't familiar with how that Consilium operates or its Laws. That might help us learn more&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-12T11:01:37-07:00","id":1508165,"title":"","content":"Elpis nods<br /> <br /> \u201dOh yeah, good point, they would know stuff like that. I think\u2026Clean Sweep is still at the Njord\u2019s Draugh\u2026but should we ask him? I don\u2019t think I know any other th\u00e9archs, at least by name.\u201d","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-12T12:10:27-07:00","id":1508171,"title":"","content":"&quot;You would need to be careful. If you steer the topic towards Demandred, I doubt he wouldn't piece it together, diplomats need to be able to read between the lines to do their job well.<br /> <br /> You could say you eventually want to join the Legacy, but you saw how much tension there was when everyone else left. You don't want to be caught in a political crossfire, so you are asking him for advice, since that is his Order's fort\u00e9. Put the ball in his court, then see what he reccomends.&quot;\u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-12T13:13:43-07:00","id":1508183,"title":"","content":"&quot;We should probably head back then, hopefully, he hasn't left by now.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-12T13:28:00-07:00","id":1508191,"title":"","content":"&quot;Good call, we can go over the rest of the memory afterwards&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-14T22:57:02-07:00","id":1508419,"title":"","content":"The sign on the Draught's door has been flipped to read &quot;open&quot;, but hasn't yet filled up in the short time the Mages have been gone. Nighthawk has abandoned her booth, and is now talking quietly at the bar with Clean Sweep. A young couple now occupies where she had been sitting, and in the back corner a fidgeting old man mumbles to himself as he pokes at a salad.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-15T00:04:56-07:00","id":1508421,"title":"","content":"\u201c<i>What am I going to say? I hope it\u2019s not too awkward that we left and came back.\u201d</i><br /> <br /> Elpis takes a breath, before walking over to the the pair. They wait for a pause in the conversation before speaking.<br /> <br /> \u201dHello, Nighthawk, Clean Sweep. Uh, can I take a moment of your time, Claviger? I would appreciate some advice. I fear I may be soon walking on very unstable footing, if I\u2019m not already.\u201d","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-17T00:23:36-07:00","id":1508612,"title":"","content":"Clean Sweep looks up, his eyebrows raising slightly. <br /> <br /> &quot;Neokoros! You and the Talon are back again already? I'll be happy to help, if I can. Whadya think Hawky, got time to advise the new-bloods?&quot;<br /> <br /> Nighthawk shrugs, leaning back in her seat. &quot;My night's clear. Vamp wards haven't tripped in weeks, its almost starting to get boring.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Shockingly, your boredom bodes well for the rest of us. So, what's bothering you kid? Changeling courtship? Lycanthropic legalities? Spirit shenanigans? Left-Handed leanings?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-17T01:45:10-07:00","id":1508620,"title":"","content":"<i>&quot;Oh wait. Maybe I should ask about Courts. Wait did Gil and Jayce talk about their courts? Maybe it would be better to ask th-no, no focus.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> &quot;Uh no. Well, I guess Hyleen Cottage looks like a Spirit could be haunting it, but no. I guess I should start at the beginning. As you probably saw, Qaf and I were negotiating with Gil when everyone else was having that meeting with the people from White Sands. After I guess they finished their business with the Consilium, they left for their next stop. But before they left, Voter Ferdiad gave me his business card, and told me he would sponsor my initiation into the Elan legacy, which was very generous of him, but...I'm worried. Everyone seemed so tense going into the meeting, and worse afterward, even Gil and Jaye noticed! Qaf said he had plans to protect us if a fight had broken out. He, uh, seemed very enthusiastic about being prepared, is that normal for an Arrow? Nevermind. Anyways, when I talked to Cloudchaser, she recommended not getting involved with him. But he might be my only way of Officially being initiated into the Elan. And they are very serious about being legacy members being initiated through the proper means. If I get involved, I think that might make trouble for everyone here. If I go behind the back of the Legacy, that would most certainly anger them, and make even more trouble for everyone...I guess I don't really know anything about White Sands, or how they would react to stuff in general. I'd hate to make problems, but I don't really know what I can say or do without upsetting someone. I wanted to talk to Qaf about what he thought, and he immediately recommended talking to you, since you would be familiar with the Lex, and probably interacted with White Sands before, and maybe even dealt with something like my situation before... So, uh, do you have any advice to help me avoid causing a diplomatic incident?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-18T02:36:15-07:00","id":1508726,"title":"","content":"Clean Sweep looks troubled. &quot;Hyleen? Nasty place. No spirits this side of the Gauntlet though - you get some pretty bad Apathy, Sloth, and Dispair spirits in that neighborhood, but they can feed well on the ley-flows without crossing over. Been like that for centuries, as far as the Shadowwalker records can tell. No one knows why. Me and my Shoal do a sweep around there sometimes, but as you can see, weather spirits are more my specialty.&quot;<br /> <br /> Nighthawk shoots him a confused look, then sighs in exasperation. She reaches out to rapidly boop Qaf and Elpis in turn on the nose, a spell firing as she does. Immediately a wave of cold engulfs their eyes, and the world takes on an oddly misty cast. Clean Sweep is now surrounded by a shoal of floating fish made of bubbles, as well as a few cheery, tiny, cartoonish figures.<br /> <br /> &quot;Hawk! Rude!&quot; Clean Sweep gasps, aghast<br /> <br /> &quot;Sweep! Oblivious!&quot; Nighthawk snaps back, gesturing at the two young Mages. &quot;They're not equipped to see Twilight. I doubt they'd be as calm as they are if they could see my companions.&quot; She makes an odd motion with one hand, as iff scratching the chin if an unseen pet.<br /> <br /> &quot;I... suppose not... But still! Don't cast on people uninvited!&quot; He sighs as Nighthawk shrugs indifferently. &quot;Anyway... the Lex. Officially, the Lex has no jurisdiction over Legacies, which would be an Iron Law. No Iron Law on Legacies here, beyond which ones we've declared Anathema. White Sand, if I remember what I head at the last Grand Convention, only requires that every initiate be given a full brief on the benefits and drawbacks of the Legacy by a practitioner of at least Adept rank. And it has to be witnessed by a senior Lictor, with demonstrations to back up claims. As you might imagine, that makes it an unpopular place with secretive Legacies.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Gonna be some new Iron Laws down there soon, by the sound of it.&quot; Nighthawk mutters into her glass. &quot;Damn autocratic bureaucracy.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I didn't interact with Pandora much -my condolences, by the way, though I'm sure you're getting sick of hearing that- but her approach to her Legacy seemed like it would welcome anyone with the gumption and skill to self-initiate. I don't know if the rest of the Legacy are like that, she <i>was</i> all alone out here, but you've basically got the approval of two practitioners at this point, don't you? Pandora, and Ferdiad?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-18T06:03:29-07:00","id":1508741,"title":"","content":"<i>&quot;So there is a chance for Elpis to self-initiate into the Elan. We are also going through the proper channels in our Consilium and have a witness that we did, which should mitigate any complaints any Legacy members could have. This might also means we are being given permission to use Postcognition to see the soul stone before it was unstable, or at least look back in the room of the Sanctum where it was being kept, that could be a valuable lead. So far, so good, let's see where this goes&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Qaf looks at the spirits for a bit, a bit surprised at how they look<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;I did not expect weather spirits to look so harmless, I wonder what area they are originally from ? Questions for later, gotta stay sharp. Hold up, did he say an Adept at a Legacy is required for the demonstration ? You would need to have learned the fourth Attainment, that requires a very powerful master, does that mean White Sands has very few sanctioned ones ?&quot;</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-18T17:48:33-07:00","id":1508798,"title":"","content":"&quot;<i>Apathy, Despair, and Sloth? Would mean that Spirits would interfere if we tried to generate positive resonance? We might need to ask for help on that. Gah, Spirits are so </i><i>unnerving. Living, moving fields of Resonance, that have cannibalism as the order of the day? That would as soon eat me or possess me as talk to me? I don't know how anyone could be comfortable with that as a Famil-Hey what's Nighthawk doing?....Oh....oh god. Ok, Ok it's fine, they are probably happy to stay over there...just focus on the information. Those are Weather Spirits...which are bubble fish? I...why are they bubble fish? I thought it would be more like a screaming fog cloud or something. They are...almost...cute....What does Nighthawk have as a companion if those don't freak us out, but it would. No, no, got to focus.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> <br /> <i>&quot;</i>Uh, well, she didn't speak of the wider Legacy very often, but she did describe the basic process in which I could have been initiated. When a prospective member shows interest, or the Legacy is interested in them, those who have Mastered the Legacy debate whether the prospect should even be considered worthy...or at least those who have obtained the highest Knowledge in places with no Master...In my case, that was solely Pandora's call, since she was the only legacy member in Little Atlantis. If she believed I was worthy and ready, she would initiate me. She...wouldn't have minded if anyone pursued the Legacy without guidance, she believed that the honest pursuit would help one become worthy...But the rest of the Legacy would mind.&quot;<br /> <br /> Elpis takes a moment to sigh, before continuing.<br /> <br /> &quot;Not every Consilium welcomes the Elan, some have driven us out, and declared us Left Handed. The Legacy at large believes that this reaction will fade given time, but they say that the only way for consilii to accept us requires new initiates to have the guidance and support of established Elans. To initiate with a soul stone, or to go to Lilith, would be seen as stealing the legacy's secrets. Even with Pandora's prior approval, I had not been fully initiated. It would be seen as taking advantage of her death, to seize knowledge before I was acknowledged as ready. If I had good intentions, why wouldn't I seek out other Elan to learn from? It might have been understandable, given that I was not aware of the locations of any other Elans who could teach me, and it might have been begrudgingly accepted. But that was before Voter Ferdiad contacted me and gave me his card. While his sponsorship wouldn't guarantee my initiation into the Legacy, it would be extremely likely. Now, if I learned the Legacy from an outside source, I would be insulting his offer, and implicitly the structure of the Legacy as a whole. Even if I found another Elan who would teach me, I would still be likely to upset him. So, now the only way I can see to not anger anyone would be to go to him...or Pandora's Echo.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I guess I'm a bit surprised at the Legacy being in White Sands with that Iron Law. While we don't mind talking about some things, the Legacy likes keeping some of its practices secret until one is fully initiated. Maybe there are secrets kept known only to the Masters Not even I know exactly what trials I might face in initiation, apart from the Summoning of a Supernal Entity of Mind or Prime. While showing off isn't forbidden...it's a bit out of character for what Pandora told me of the Legacy. Maybe they have some other reason for being there?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-20T02:56:25-07:00","id":1509014,"title":"","content":"&quot;I never got the whole 'Legacy culture' thing. I beat the piss out Ghosts down below until one coughed up the secrets of the Bokor, and I turned out just fine. Never even met another living practitioner.&quot;<br /> <br /> Clean Sweep gives Nighthawk a dry look, ordering another drink from Gil with a casual wave. \u200b&quot;Yes, and now you spend your friday nights taking to dead people and being our designated Buffy. Very well-adjusted.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;If you're fishing for a date, I'm partial to Raven &amp; Rose.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Everyone's partial to Raven &amp; Rose. You do have a point though - Elpis, there's an angle you don't seem to be considering. What will you do with the Legacy once you join? Hang out in their clubhouse, drink the kool-aid? Will you take apprentices of your own, eventually? There's something to be said for setting up your own independent branch of the house - it breeds resilience and makes it far more difficult to wipe out.&quot;<br /> <br /> Nighthawk knocks back her drink, then appropriates Clean Sweep's. &quot;Look, little lamb. You're one of us, and Pandora was too. The Consilium won't kick you out for following in her footsteps, and most of us will welcome an expert in Prime matters. We <i>might</i> take issue with Ferdiad and his lot coming around, and you going there might paint a target on your back. There's a reckoning a-coming, unless I've missed the mark. Just... be careful, whatever you decide.<br /> <br /> &quot;What about you, angel-boy? Got any plans for spending that Supernal Coin we call a soul?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":27258,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","user":"Cauthon","date":". 04-20-2023, 06:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-20T09:49:29-07:00","id":1509050,"title":"","content":"<i>&quot;A reckoning ? So we are on the same page, war is inevitable if the Adamantine Crown is in power.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> &quot;No plans besides keep searching. Storm Keepers have some interesting abilities, but I don't think I will specialize in weather magic. The Perfected Adepts are an Arrow classic, but right now I resonate more with Time rather than Life. I think that will be the Arcanum I focus on, but I haven't seen many Time Legacies in the Consilium. So the plan was to gain more experience, broaden my horizons and see what I find. But I think it might pay to be more careful, you mentioned a reckoning is coming ?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 04-20-2023, 01:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-20T14:01:12-07:00","id":1509091,"title":"","content":"&quot;We could probably get ahold of a Wave-man, if you want to join the Brotherhood of the Demon Wind. They like to wander, and experienced fighters are something we lack. Any idea what you'd want to <i>do</i> with Time? My boss' side-project is compiling a comprehensive Legacy index, and Hiawatha has visited nearly every Consilium under the sun.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;At least in North America. The man is <i>not</i> a fan of crossing the ocean.&quot; Nighthawk giggles, sliding Clean Sweep's new drink towards herself.<br /> <br /> &quot;Between them, we can find you a good fit. The Ladder here takes pride in helping everyone find the best match for their soul, and if you're looking to get in good with Chevalier it would be a smart move.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;'Course, then you'd owe Hiawatha and Chevalier a solid. Which might not bite you in the ass normally, but we might have war declared on us in the near future. And half the western seaboard, if a third of what I've heard about Demandred is true. Who names themselves after a storybook villain?!&quot;<br /> <br /> Clean Sweep slowly takes Nighthawk's glass, his brow furrowed in concern.<br /> <br /> &quot;Gil, did you give us Arcadian Absinthe? Tongues are getting looser than they should.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":27258,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","user":"Cauthon","date":". 04-20-2023, 05:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-20T15:53:50-07:00","id":1509110,"title":"","content":"<i>&quot;Jackpot, we just hit the key topic. Well done Gil, since you did hear about PMS, you probably used normal alcohol, but it made a difference. Now hopefully we can find more about what happened to Pandora and have a better idea what the Adamantine Crown are up to.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> &quot;Right now I would choose a Legacy that focuses on speed and efficiency. While Time has a lot of interesting strategic uses, I really appreciate how it grants the ability to react quickly and pivot. I heard the Wave-men use it to be quick and precise. They are one of the Legacies I was thinking about, although I heard they have a focus on melee weapons, or at least that is what they are renowned for. I am trained in hand to hand combat, so I am not sure if it qualifies for initiation. But I never met a member, so I haven't had the chance to ask.&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Now on to the main topic. I need to be careful on how to approach this.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> &quot;Being able to look through a more detailed list of Legacies would be helpful, normally I do not mind owing someone a solid, but what does that mean in wartime ? An Awakened war to engulf the entire western seaboard, its hard to imagine what that would be like.....&quot;<br /> <br /> Qaf puts a hand to his chin<br /> <br /> &quot;Demandred is not a name from this Consilium and he was not in the group that just arrived for the meeting. I haven't been to the White Sands Consilium before or had a chance to meet him, could I ask for a bit more context ?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-20T16:18:33-07:00","id":1509112,"title":"","content":"Clean Sweep places a hand over Nighthawk's mouth as she begins to answer, earning him a glare and a pinched side.<br /> <br /> &quot;Best if you wait for your Herald to deliver our announcement on the matter, Talon. The cat's not out of the bag yet, even if it's managed to get it's head out the hole.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Screw that Sweep, they heard enough already. And I doubt anyone thought to put a time-ward on the room upstairs, so they could just go Post-cog what we said as soon as we leave. Here's the deal kids - White Sand went full fascist. As in, purges. Their new Hierarch is named Demandred, which a simple Google search tells me is the name of an absolute psychopath of a wizard in a fantasy novel, so he isn't even subtle about it. While that wouldn't be grounds for war normally -I abhore how London runs things, but we ain't marching on <i>them</i>- they have some beef with Moros that they're angling to turn into a pretext for conquest. Even if we don't declare on them, <i>they're </i> likely to declare on <i>us</i> when we refuse to play ball.&quot;<br /> <br /> Gil has sunk behind the counter, staying as far out of sight as he can manage. &quot;I just serve the drinks people order from me. Why does that always end up with me being blamed for their choices?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-21T16:56:52-07:00","id":1509239,"title":"","content":"<i>&quot;Wait, what ? We have permission to actually spy on the meeting ? I did not expect that. They didn't even ward it ? They have a master spy, a veteran warrior and the Councilors. None of them thought of it ? How ? Why ? They are supposed to be experts, how come I am more careful than them ? Did I overestimate the importance of this meeting ?&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Qaf has put his hand down now and takes a moment to parse what he just heard<br /> <br /> &quot;Its really okay to Post-cog the meeting and it was not Shielded ? I'm actually pretty surprised, thank you for telling us.&quot;<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;If he has declared for the Adamant Crown, then he is confident in his preparations, no way he could have had support for this insanity normally. Which means Pandora could have been caught in the crossfire&quot;</i><br /> <br /> &quot;Demandred just takes office and he declares a purge ? He probably has a strong support base if such an insane idea passed. Ferdiad was here as a representative, what a weird stance for a Libertine to take.&quot;\u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-21T17:44:01-07:00","id":1509242,"title":"","content":"&quot;Uh, no, that was <i>not</i> permission.&quot; Clean Sweep tries to glare at both Nighthawk and Qaf at once. &quot;It's just Hawk pointing out that we did a piss-poor job of things if we meant to keep the meeting private.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I don't know what the Assembly over there is doing, if they're supporting this. Ferdiad and his fellows might just be class-traitors who turned on their brethren. Don't forget your own Order's maxims, angel-boy - might makes right. All he needed to do is eliminate dissenters, and right now we don't know what the Awakened population of White Sand looks like.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-21T20:50:57-07:00","id":1509249,"title":"","content":"<i>\u201cWhat? Why would Nighthawk tell us to look at the meeting?!? Was I having my heart nearly falling out of my chest for nothing?!?\u201d</i><br /> <br /> \u201cP -p-purges? Of dissenters\u2026how could anyone follow him? How could the Elan stand behind\u2026\u201d<br /> <br /> <i>\u201dQaf\u2026I don\u2019t know what would motivate an Assembly to follow such a leader\u2026but the Elan\u2026as estranged as Pandora was, she still as close as family\u201d</i><br /> <br /> \u201c\u2026he said they failed to protect her. When he gave me the card, he\u2026What did he mean by that?\u201d<br /> <br /> Elpis pauses, and turns to look Clean Sweep directly in the eye. Their gaze holds a uncomfortable intensity.<br /> <br /> \u201cHow exactly is my mentor involved?\u201d","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-22T11:06:34-07:00","id":1509302,"title":"","content":"<i>&quot;Was that bait, suggesting the Arrow works by might makes right ? Are you trying to test how likely I would agree with the Adamantine Crown ? Might as well take the chance to make it clear I am against them&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Qaf looks like he is ready to start a counterpoint, but he sees Elpis' reaction and stops<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;This might give us the lead we are looking for. Patience Qaf, do not get rattled and overplay your hand, or we might lose a major clue&quot;</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-23T00:32:27-07:00","id":1509354,"title":"","content":"&quot;As far as we know?&quot; Nighthawk gives a disinterested shrug. &quot;Not at all. Ferdiad and Cynosure implied that her death is being used as an excuse for starting the Moros persecution though.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;And it's a shakey justification at best.&quot; Clean Sweep drums his fingers on the bar, uneasy. &quot;Qaf, have you ever hear of the Bellerophon Group?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-23T09:00:28-07:00","id":1509383,"title":"","content":"Qaf shakes his head","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-24T03:10:05-07:00","id":1509464,"title":"","content":"&quot;Well, It's not like I know much about them anyway, but they're supposed to be experts on Rapture. A loose network of Mages who've made it their obsession to understand the mechanics and intricacies of the process. Supposedly they've been able to rehab Rapt before, but I'll believe that when I see it.<br /> <br /> &quot;Anyway, they're supposed to mostly be Arrows, which is why I thought you might have heard of them. Ferdiad and Cynosure implied that Pandora's death was caused by the Bellerophon Group, as well as by the Guardians. They said outright that Santiago wasn't in a bad odor with them over it though, so... well, I'll let you draw your own conclusions, but my money is on White Sand's Bellerophon contingent being Guardian-heavy. Possibly just one, a Moros.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Makes sense.&quot; Nighthawk mutters sourly. &quot;Guardians keep the Veil, and Rapt are walking Veil breaches.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-24T10:05:36-07:00","id":1509487,"title":"","content":"<i>&quot;So they are Arrows ? Makes it easier to ask around. Since they are experts on Rapture, I would be surprised if Elpis didn't want to meet them. Still, Nighthawk knows Death magic, might as well see what they think of the theory&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;</i>Even if they had an issue with how the Bellerophon member acted, normally it would escalate to a Duel Arcane first, the Moros are definitely being scapegoated. But there is one more thing that doesn't quite fit. Pandora's showed no anomalies before Rapture, no shifts in the reach and power of her Nimbus, no changes in her behavior, nothing, just zero to a hundred, with no middle ground. Let's use Occam's razor here, if her soul was not unstable, then it was made unstable, which might explain how sudden this all was. Now I am hearing the expert in Rapture is being isolated and that attention is being drawn away from this case and into a pretty major political matter, which sounds like a very effective way to make sure other Awakened are too preoccupied to poke around. But I don't know enough about the soul to know if that could be a possibility.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 04-24-2023, 03:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2647"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-24T12:37:40-07:00","id":1509512,"title":"","content":"\u201c<i>\u2026so they are experts on Rapture. I must have read some of their research at some point unless it\u2019s serious enough to be beyond my access level\u2026No, that\u2019s probably just a rumor. If they could truly heal the souls of the Rapt, everyone would know. Something that monumental would be celebrated as heroic by every Mage. Even the Guardians would have to acknowledge it. The amount of good they could do\u2026if they really can redeem the Rapt, why then\u2026why would they kill Pandora instead of save her? No\u2026I don\u2019t believe it. I can\u2019t. I\u2026must know the truth. But where to start looking? I\u2026oh Qaf is speaking.\u201d</i><br /> <br /> Elpis nods to affirm Qaf\u2019s words.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-28T03:49:09-07:00","id":1509941,"title":"","content":"&quot;It's possible. I don't know enough about White Sands to make a judgement call though.&quot; Clean Sweep lets out a long sigh, pressing his palm heels over his eyes. &quot;Well, this has been a great wrapup to my weekend. Got anything else you two want to talk about? Otherwise, I'll be heading home.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-14T22:22:21-07:00","id":1511697,"title":"","content":"It's been several days since Elpis and Qaf had their Hallow-tour, with everything being surprisingly buisness-as-usual. An announcement of White Sands' proclamation was delivered to both mages by a pudgy -if strong- woman who introduced herself as Liberty. Nothing in the announcement was a surprise, although there was a definite downplaying of the more aggressive sentiments that The Draught was party to.<br /> <br /> It's Thursday, and Elpis has just gotten a text from Jaye.<br /> <br /> [Cleon (construction contractor) open to meeting. Wants to see property. Acceptable/address?]","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":27258,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","user":"Cauthon","date":".  Adjusting precedent. Texting will now be depicted with [ ] 05-19-2023, 04:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-18T17:57:03-07:00","id":1512065,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://filedata/fetch?filedataid=1242\" target=\"_blank\"><a href=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=1242\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" ><img title=\"image.png\" data-tempid=\"temp_1242_1684457415729_8\" width=\"188\" height=\"138\" data-align=\"none\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=1242&amp;type=small\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=1242\" data-thumb-url=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=1242&amp;type=thumb\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"image.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-need-data-att-update js-lightbox-participant\" itemprop=\"image\"/></a></a><br /> <b>Philophrosyne</b><br /> It was morning. Philly decided to pack up camp and come down the east side of the mountain towards the ski resort. She\u2019d pick up her truck there and head back to LA. She had been up in the peaks for a few weeks now, since New Years, practicing honing her form to survive in the cold temperatures and thin air. There were not many animals awake up there this time of year. All the bears and wild cats were in hibernation, but she could sense them sleeping, feeling the web of life all around her even under the thick powder of snow.<br /> <br /> She took long strides, pushing herself to eat up distance while still trying to get used to the snowshoes. She\u2019d never been up here this time of year. She had also packed low rations and was trying to fast with a slower metabolism.<br /> <br /> Philly wanted more. More of this. Just looking out with mundane and magical sight to take in the world with all richness. Was that all she wanted, or was there also something pulling her towards the invisible, and beyond that to the Supernal? To the Primal Wild, and Ecstasy. She felt like she wanted to become what she saw, all this beauty. But she also feared being swallowed up by it. Was that fear wisdom? She had come up here after the holidays to sort some of it out in her own heart and head. She had told some of the sleeper side of her family that she was going on a \u201cSpiritual Retreat\u201d. They nodded with approval, but also worried about her safety. A young woman way up there on the mountain alone. That didn\u2019t seem safe.<br /> <br /> Well, it wasn\u2019t. It wasn\u2019t safe. And that\u2019s what she had wanted. To not be safe. To go beyond the limits of safety into something else.<br /> <br /> She had turned off her phone. Gasp. What would everyone think of that. Not that it mattered that much. Reception sucked up here this time of year.<br /> <br /> She finally picked up something resembling a park service trail and moved faster down, adjusting her oxygen intake as necessary, moving below the tree line. Finally she got to the resort and started looing for her truck.<br /> <br /> She looked around at all the resort guests coming and going, and over at the luxurious lodge. Civilization. She wondered if any of her old college friends were here, but she didn\u2019t stop to check. She got on the road in the late afternoon, and adjusted her eyesight for the sun setting.<br /> <br /> It would be late before she got back to her uncle\u2019s house, where she was currently crashing. She pulled over for a pizza in Pleasant Valley. She had been dreading it all day, but she turned her phone back on, and then set it in the cup holder while it blew up. After a few minutes she picked it up again.<br /> <br /> Let\u2019s see. Voice Mail full. No duh. Gazillion missed calls from mom. One missed call from dad. Gazillion texts from mom. She had told her where she was going. Lots of Instagram posts from sorority sisters and other assorted friends. Grandma's been busy on Facebook. Indeed, Monster, Linkdn, along with several personal job offers from concerned relatives and family friends.<br /> <br /> \u201cOne word Benjamin. Plastics.\u201d She thought.<br /> <br /> And then as if her thought had summoned the ghost of <a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?gs_ssp=eJzj4tTP1TcwTEnKNjNg9OJJzMtTSErMSy7KTysBAFxqB9o&amp;q=ann+bancroft&amp;rlz=1C1ONGR_enUS936US936&amp;oq=&amp;aqs=chrome.2.35i39i362l2j46i39i362j35i39i362l2j46i39i362j35i39i362j46i39i362.493892286j0j15&amp;sourceid=chrome&amp;ie=UTF-8\" target=\"_blank\">Anne Bancroft</a> \u2013 a message from Chevalier.<br /> She opened it.<br /> \u200b<br /> \u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-19T13:40:40-07:00","id":1512140,"title":"","content":"For a woman literally born at the turn of the last century, Chevalier has surprisingly little trouble with texting. Granted, Life and Death magic -and a significant bout of temporal shenanigans- mean she's maybe half her chronological age and looks even younger. Philly has never quite been clear on how the woman is related to her -she definitely <i>is</i> but no-one can give a clear answer on <i>how</i>- but everyone in the family just calls her &quot;aunty&quot;.<br /> <br /> [Philly, cher, I hope your little jaunt has been fulfilling. Once you get around to reading your messages, I'd appreciate you proceeding to my residence with all haste. A perfect opportunity has come up for you - a pair of debutantes are forming a new Circle. The weather girl has wrangled them an old property that used to belong to our august house, which gives you an easy in. I've tossed the bones cher, whatever is going to happen in that old cenotaph will be good for you.]","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-20T12:39:11-07:00","id":1512234,"title":"","content":"Philly snorts. <i>Jaunt. Yeah. That\u2019s what that was. On top of a snow covered dormant volcano in the dead of winter.</i><br /> <br /> <i>Auntie Chev has a wonderful plan. Oh brother. Debutants does not sound promising, especially after looking at all those Instagram pics. Chana should not be giving Starbucks her Shadow name for her peppermint mocha order, even as a joke. And Twix with her new cabal and her new Alchemist boyfriend and blah blah blah. But then Philly has a twinge of guilt. Family and friends are important. You can\u2019t live like a hermit on top of a mountain all your life. Can you?</i><br /> <br /> <i>An old house. That\u2019s intriguing. I wonder which one she means? How old. What kind of condition is it in? How many square feet is it. How many acres? Drainage? Termites? What is the neighborhood, on this side and the other side, like? Some of those decorating pics she scrolled through were kind of cute. What does she mean by \u201cUsed to belong\u201d? What\u2019s the story there?</i><br /> <br /> <i>\u201cTossed the bones.\u201d Its so hard to think about Fate, when there is so much in the Here and Now. Looking forward and backwards does not come easy, but I guess for some mages it does. Everyone means well. Everyone wants what\u2019s best for me. What do I want. If there is a pattern of Fate, do I even have a choice?</i><br /> <br /> Philly looks down at the empty pizza box. <i>Pig. Well I guess I hadn\u2019t eaten anything in like a week.</i><br /> <br /> She pulls out of the parking lot and back on to the highway. She gets to Little A at dusk, just before the shadows have completely turned to dark and there is still a twinge of blue in the sky. The light pollution drowns out the stars and she sighs. As she goes down the main drag she thinks of all the memories of this town that is so much a part of who she is. All the shops and restaurants, the post office and bank, and the elementary school with the fingerprint pictures on the windows. She hears the night train pulling through down at the tracks. <br /> <br /> Philly pulls up to Auntie Chevalier\u2019s house.<br /> \u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-21T13:27:34-07:00","id":1512297,"title":"","content":"The door swings as Philly approaches it, the faint tingle of something supernatural tugging at her unseen senses. The hallway it reveals is as barren as always - the minimal furniture necessary to receive visitors, but no decorations or touches of personalization. Some people think Chevalier's house is just a blind, and she actually lives in a pocket of the Shadow, or a Pocket Dimension. Very little evidence to the contrary exists, to be certain, but it's also possible she just doesn't care about her domicile.<br /> <br /> Chevalier is seated on a couch just past the entryway, idly reading a well-dogeared book. She smiles and stands as Philly enters, adjusting voluminous trousers and straightening a colorful sash-belt.<br /> <br /> &quot;Well here you are, all safe and in one piece! And with enough wilderness Resonance on you to keep a dryad content for ages, my word.&quot; She glances ostentatiously at the slim watch handling loosly around her wrist &quot;Have you had dinner yet, cher? We can talk about your peers over a meal, if not. Much more civilized than those endless dossiers Cloudchaser keeps foisting on me.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-21T18:47:12-07:00","id":1512322,"title":"","content":"Philly was never sure what to make of Auntie Chev's &quot;home&quot;. She waivered between admiring its simplicity and feeling that it was not very welcoming. Shouldn't the place you live be an extension of your nimbus; a reflection of your soul? She wondered about the itching and prickling she was feeling. A place that seemed to be so devoid of life, yet so full of magic. <i>Obrimos. </i>She thought of that movie she had seen where heaven was depicted as being in black and white and only the fallen world was in color. Is that how Chevalier saw the Aether?<br /> <br /> &quot;Uh, I ate something earlier&quot; <i>A whole pizza. </i>&quot;But, um, I guess I could eat something&quot; <i>It would be rude to say no. I am curious about the house and what is has to do with Cloudchaser. If the house used to belong to the Silver Ladder, what does the Mysterium have to do with it?</i><br /> <br /> Philly knew a little bit about the other orders, but she had also lived her whole life inside the tight knit social world of her family and the Silver Ladder. There were lots of people in her family who seemed to think of the other orders in the Diamond as &quot;the help&quot;. And her cousin Kinsley's parents almost disowned her when he had that fling with a Libertine.<br /> <br /> Philly had misgivings about joining a cabal if it was anything like her sorority in college. She wanted to make a real difference in the world and follow deeper into her path. Everything that she experienced in college just seemed so shallow to her. <i>I still care about my friends, but I want more than that.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-23T15:21:04-07:00","id":1512494,"title":"","content":"&quot;We'll head down to Raven &amp; Rose then. A nice light meal - I believe Reginald just received a shipment of fresh fruit for salads.&quot; Chevalier pulls out a fluted silver rod, barely thicker than her thumb and nearly six inches long. It seems to hum at the edge of perception as she taps it against the front door, which she then opens. <br /> <br /> Rather than the bland -if well manicured- lawn, the doorway now opens onto Raven &amp; Rose's dark-panneled reception area. Chevalier strolls through unhurriedly, linking arms with Philly to pull her along. Glancing back, Philly notices that from the restaurant's side the door appears to open onto the street as it normally would.<br /> <br /> &quot;Ah, Ms. Langston. Your usual table?&quot; The deep voice of Maurice, one of the twins who runs the Rose, greets them. His piggy eyes and deep jowls give him a somewhat funerary air, when taken in tandem with his baritone. <br /> <br /> &quot;If it wouldn't be a bother, Mr. Feldman. My niece has had quite a long trip, I'd like to treat her to a nice, quiet meal.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Of course, madam. Right this way.&quot;<br /> <br /> *<br /> <br /> Once seated, Chevalier gives the menu a cursory glance before focusing on Philly. <br /> <br /> &quot;Order what tickles your fancy cher, but be prepared to talk as we dine. Tell me, what do you know of Hyleen Cottage and the Circle -oh, fine, Cabal- that called themselves The Corenne?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-24T20:08:45-07:00","id":1512670,"title":"","content":"\u201cOh no,\u201d Philly squeaks, Pheobe Buffay style as, as Chevalier pulls her through the portal into the Raven and Rose foyer. She quickly snatches at a supernal thought of cleanliness and put-togetherness, some scraps of fashion magazine memory, and if she is being really honest an old memory of watching the Disney Version of Cinderella as a little girl, and pushes prime into it, her life pattern almost having a psychosomatic urge to puke. She blurts out some old \u201cCharm School\u201d Atlantean and prays to the Atavisms that there are no Sleepers standing there. <i>Sometimes Auntie Chev acts like a lunatic.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcR79XTrz0b1x5Q4x35_7Jn03JDyB_fj1pPKZiu8z1Mi5R0CkKV1BeixpAW042n8KFzYsoM&amp;usqp=CAU\" target=\"_blank\">She looked down at herself.</a> <i>Well... maybe this is overdoing things.</i><br /> <br /> \u201cAuntie!\u201d Philly hisses, and glares down at Chevalier \u2013 a look which the older woman completely ignores.<br /> <br /> As they walk through the restaurant, Philly feels a sense of discomfort, not only with the illusioned attire, but with the whole vibe of the restaurant. Despite her quick change, she doesn\u2019t feel like she fits in in this world. Maybe its just that she has been up in the mountains too long. <i>And these &quot;not really&quot; heals, but they sure damn feel like heels, are killing me.</i><br /> <br /> \u201cUm.. to be honest, I only know that they were left-handed. There was a purge. And that\u2019s why the Iron Star is in charge now.\u201d<br /> <br /> Not that that she was ever at a meeting or anything like that, but she knew mages and sleepwalkers in college who basically viewed the Iron Star and Guardians as being no different from Seers. Magical Fascists. She never talked about it though. She didn\u2019t always agree with her parents and older family members, but there was something comforting about the world she grew up in. It was kind of cool and exciting to think about radical ideas, but also maybe a little scary. There was something inside Philly that always seemed like it wanted to break free and escape, to not play things safe, but she always seemed to keep it bottled up.<br /> <br /> \u201cI\u2019m not even sure where the cottage is. I don\u2019t think I know anyone who\u2019s been there. Oh\u2026Zeus. I think Zeus said something about it one time at party.\u201d <i>When he. Was. Drunk\u2026</i><br /> <br /> She looks at the menu while the waiter taps his toe.<i> Salad. Fruit. Salad. Fruit. Fruit Salad. Fruit on salad. It\u2019s Winter for Merlin\u2019s sake!</i> She felt something in her stomach. <i>Ugh. I need carbs.</i><br /> \u201cSteak sandwich and friets. Um.. with the Wedge Salad. And may I have the local lager please.?\u201d<br /> \u201cOf course. Does the young lady have her identification?\u201d<br /> <i>Wait! This purse isn\u2019t real. Does this suit even have pockets?\u201d<br /> \u200b</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-06T04:24:45-07:00","id":1514002,"title":"","content":"Chevalier snorts &quot;The Iron Stars? Hardly. Dantes is Arrow through-and-through, and gets along with Santiago like cats and dogs. Thank heavens the mask-lovers don't have their own Circle, I shudder to think how the balance of power would have tipped.&quot;<br /> <br /> She turns a winning smile on the waiter, a lanky man with shaggy -if well-groomed- mane of hair. He seems to stiffen momentarily before a dreamy smile blooms across his face, eyes seeming unfocused. Philly's Mage Sight tingles, but Chevalier didn't seem to have cast a spell.<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh, she's hardly a child, deary. Just look at her, so vibrant and full of spunk! I'm sure Maurice and Reginald won't mind waiving that little formality. In the meantime, I'll take a green papaya salad and an order of Bl\u00e5b\u00e4rssoppa. Hot bl\u00e5b\u00e4rssoppa, if you don't mind.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Ye... yes ma'am, I'm sure Maurice and Reginald... will approve... I'll have... your orders out... shortly...&quot; The waiter walks off with a slightly mechanical cadence, slowly returning to normal by the time he arrives at the kitchen doors.<br /> <br /> &quot;Thank you <span style=\"color:#e74c3c\">Amore</span>, you're a peach&quot; Chevalier murmurs to thin air, taking a sip of water. &quot;Now then, dear Philly. I'm sure Zeus has spouted all manner of things while he's in his cups, but there's bound to have been a kernel or two of accurate information mixed in.<br /> <br /> &quot;The Cottage in out in the Heights - that part of town your mother probably told you to steer clear of. Funny how tame Little Atlantis' 'bad neighborhood' is; you <i>might</i> get mugged there on a bad night in the tourist season. The house itself is safe in any case, I confirmed Zeus' installation of the Supernal security system myself.<br /> <br /> &quot;The Hallow within is negligible, which is part of why it fell into common property after the... incident. Nobody wanted to deal with the deep cleaning. It's been <i>ages</i> though, well before my time, so I'd imagine most of what needs to be dealt with is simple mundane neglect. The Corenne's sins, though heinous, at least had the virtue of being fairly self-cleaning.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-06T07:23:40-07:00","id":1514009,"title":"","content":"The words &quot;She's hardly a child. Look at her...&quot; Seemed to drip out of Auntie Chev's mouth.<br /> <br /> <i>Ew! </i>Philly heard the all too familiar song as little motes of ...she tried to control a blush... swirled around the waiter's ears, whispering <i>...ew! I am I being a prude? Hypocrite? If it happened on its own I wouldn't mind. He is kind of cute. But using spirits seems...wrong.</i><br /> <br /> She could hear all the lectures from her mother and father growing up, even when she was little. <i>&quot;Hubris is a coward's word. Wisdom is just another word for the Lie. Magic is our birthright. Everyone has their place on the Ladder.&quot;<br /> <br /> There is such a thing as too far though. What happened to the Corenne? What were they up to? </i>She felt that deep urge to know, no mater what consequences knowing might bring. <i>&quot;Tis magic, magic that hath ravished me.&quot;</i> like a hunger. Like a predator stalking. But also like a siren's song, calling.<br /> <br /> She needed to be more careful with her own thoughts.<br /> <br /> She thought about if she had ever been up there in the Heights. Maybe <a href=\"https://hookedonhouses.net/wp-content/uploads/2011/12/Its-a-Wonderful-Life-Bailey-house-feat.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">to throw stones through the window of some old house</a> when she was younger. She wondered if <a href=\"https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/807eae0dec5c79a21e134b5b53d59e71327456cd/0_128_2060_1236/master/2060.jpg?width=700&amp;quality=85&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=max&amp;s=007314bf61a3eafe1957cabe92681e8f\" target=\"_blank\">her cousins</a> on her dad's side still lived around there. She hadn't seen them in a while. The idea of fixing up one of those old houses appealed to her. She started making a mental list of supplies and tools she would need.<br /> <br /> &quot;You mentioned a...circle. Anyone I would know?&quot; <i>Who am I kidding? I've lived here forever. My dad's family practically built the town.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","user":"CalvinSiler","date":". 06-06-2023, 08:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-07T17:17:51-07:00","id":1514148,"title":"","content":"&quot;You mentioned a...circle. Anyone I would know?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-12T09:03:56-07:00","id":1514709,"title":"","content":"Sorry. Meant to post in OCC thread.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27436-calvinsiler","name":"CalvinSiler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27436_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}